hadiths[496]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2401","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mughirah bin Muslim ne ham se bayan kiya — woh sachche Musalman the — unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne ham se bayan kiya, Wahb bin Jabir se, Abdullah bin Aas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, isi hadees jaisi, siwae is ke ke unhon ne kaha: Phir hamen bayan karne lage ke yaajuuja-maajuuja Adam ki aulaad mein se hain; agar woh logon par chhore jaen to un ki rizq bigaarenge; mein se koi na marega magar apni nasla mein se hazaar ya zyada choregaa; aur un ke peeche teen Hajj hain; wahi, taariisa aur manasaka."
"2402","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair bin Mu'awiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Muhajir se, Abdullah bin Babah se, Abdullah bin Aas se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas hazir tha — Aap paas das dinon ka zikr hua — to farmaya: Koi din nahin mein amal Allah Azza-wa Jall ko Zulhijjah ke das dinon se zyada mahboob ho kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, Allah ki raah mein jihad bhi nahin? To Aap ne use bada jana aur farmaya: Allah ki raah mein jihad bhi nahin, siwae us aadmi ke jo apni jaan-maal lekar nikle aur us mein apni jaan lagae"
"2403","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Maimun ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Haris ke beton mein se ek aadmi ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mein se Ayyub ek aadmi ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Aas ko kehte suna: Jo maut se saal bhar pahle Tauba kare, us ki qabool hogi; jo maut se din bhar pahle Tauba kare, us ki qabool hogi; jo maut se ghante bhar pahle Tauba kare, us ki qabool hogi to Main ne un se kaha: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne to farmaya: {Tauba Allah par sirf un ke liye hai jo jahalat mein burayi karte hain} aayat unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen Wahy bayan karta hun jo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna"
"2404","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Isa bin Talha se, Abdullah bin Aas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yaumunnahra ko apni sawari par farmaya, jabke log Aap se poochte rahe the ek aadmi kehta hai: Ya Rasulullah, main nahin samajhta tha ke marne qurbani se pahle hai, to Main ne marne se pahle qurbani ki to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Marne karo, koi harj nahin aur doosra kehne laga: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe nahin ma'loom tha ke halaq qurbani se pahle hai, to Main ne halaq se pahle qurbani ki farmaya: Halaq karo, koi harj nahin unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko us din bhool-anajaane mein kaamon ko aage-peeche karne aur us ke jaisi baton ke bare mein poochte nahin suna, magar farmaya: Woh karo, koi harj nahin"
"2405","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fulaih bin Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, Salim bin Abu Nazr se, Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Abdullah bin Aas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Quran mein jhagda na karo; kyunke us mein jhagda kufr hai"
"2406","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Muhammad bin Sireen aur Muhammad bin Hanafi Ubaid se, Abdullah bin Aas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah ke baaron mein se ek baade mein the ke ek aadmi ne ijazat mangi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use ijazat do aur use jannat ki khushkhabri do to woh Abu the Bakr to Main ne unhen ijazat di aur jannat ki khushkhabri di to woh Allah kehte qareeb aae yahan tak ke baithe phir buland awaz wale aadmi ne ijazat mangi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use ijazat do aur use jannat ki khushkhabri do to woh Umar the to Main ne unhen ijazat di aur jannat ki khushkhabri di to woh Allah kehte qareeb aaye phir aahista awaz wale aadmi ne ijazat mangi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use ijazat do aur use aane wali aazmaish par jannat ki khushkhabri do to Main ne unhen ijazat di aur jannat ki khushkhabri di to woh Affan ke bete Usman the to woh Allah kehte qareeb aae yahan tak ke baithe to Abdullah bin Aas ne kaha: Main kahan hun? Farmaya: Tum apne baap ke sath ho"
"2407","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ziyad bin fayyaaza se: Abu Iyaz ko suna, Abdullah bin Aas se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Mahine mein ek din roza rakho aur tumhen baqi ka ajr hai; do din roza rakho aur tumhen baqi ka ajr hai; teen din roza rakho aur tumhen baqi ka ajr hai"
"2408","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, unhon ne kaha: Hilal bin Yasaf ko suna, Abu Araz Yahya se bayan karte hue, Abdullah bin Aas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Baithkar namaz khade ki namaz se aadhi hai"
"2409","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, unhon ne kaha: Hilal bin Yasaf ko suna, Abu Araz Yahya se bayan karte hue, Abdullah bin Aas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wuzu karte logon par aae — safar mein the — to farmaya: Wuzu poora karo; Aediyon ke liye aag se afsos — ya: Takhnon ke liye; Shu'bah ne donon mein se ek kaha"
"2410","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Auza'i se, Rabi'ah bin damishqii Yazid se, bin Dailami se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Aas se kaha: Mujhe pahunchi hai ke tum bayan karte ho walidah ke pet mein kisi kisi hai to unhon ne kaha: Main kisi ko apne par jhoot bandhne ki ijazat nahin deta; Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne apni makhlooq andhere mein paida ki, phir un par apne Noor mein se Noor dala; jise us Noor mein se kuch laga woh hidayat paya, jo cuukaa woh gumrah hua"
"2411","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Urwah bin Zubair se, Abdullah bin Aas se, unhon ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Tabaraka-Ta'ala ilm chiinakara nahin karta, lekin aalimon ko un ke ilm par karta hai; yahan tak ke jab koi aalim na bache to log jahil sardar banaaenge; un se poocha jaega aur woh bataaenge; gumrah honge aur gumrah karenge"
"2412","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Shahr bin Haushab se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah Nauf bin Aas ke paas aae aur kaha: Bayan karo; hamen bayan se mana kiya gaya hai to unhon ne kaha: Main bayan na karunga jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se Quraish ka ek aadmi mere paas hai to Abdullah bin Aas ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Hijrat ke baad hijrat hogi; zameen ke behtareen Ibrahim ki hijaratagaaha ki taraf hain, aur zameen mein us ke badtareen bache rahenge; un ki zameen unhen ugalengii, Allah ki nafs unhen napasand karegi, aag unhen bandar-suar ke sath jama karegi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mashriq ki taraf se log hain jo Quran padhenge, un ke halaq se na utaregaa; jab bhi seeng kategaa, seeng niklega; jab bhi seeng kategaa, seeng niklega; jab bhi seeng kategaa, seeng niklega; phir un ke baqi mein Dajjal nikalegaa."
"2413","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Makhzum ke beton mein se ek aadmi ko suna, apne chacha se bayan karte hue, ke Mu'awiyah vahta ko Abdullah bin Aas se le chahte the, aur Unhon ne apne ghulamon ko hathiyaarabanda hone ka hukm diya to un se is mein kaha gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo apne maal par qatl ho woh shaheed hai"
"2414","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansoor ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Salim bin Abu Ja'd ko suna, shumaita bin nubaita se bayan karte hue, jaabaana se, Abdullah bin Aas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jannat mein nafarman dakhil na hoga, na ehsan jataane wala, na haram ki aulaad, na aadii."
"2415","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sauri Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah bin Umar se, Zuhri se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Najashi par chaar takbiren kahin"
"2416","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum Jume ke din apne bhai se kaho jabke imam khutba de: Khamosh raho, to Tum ne behuudagii ki"
"2417","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz khadi ho to chalo aur tum par itminan ho; jo pao padho, jo se us ki qaza karo"
"2418","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Fazarah ke beton mein se ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pukara aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, meri biwi ne mere liye kala ladka jana; yeh kaise, Ya Rasulullah? Farmaya: Kya tumhare oont hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han farmaya: Un ke rang Kya hain? Unhon ne kaha: Surkh farmaya: Kya mein khaki hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han farmaya: Woh kaise? Unhon ne kaha: Nas ne kheencha, Aey Allah ke farmaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh bhi ho sakta hai nas ne kheencha ho to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen us se nafi ki ijazat na di"
"2419","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne, Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Fitrat paanch hain: Nakhun kaatna, zer-istidad mundna, thaile ukhedna, miswak aur khatanaa."
"2420","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne, Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaha na karo; Shehri dehati ki taraf se na beche; aadmi apne bhai ke paigham par paigham na de, na us ke bai par Saudah kare"
"2421","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne, Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Isa bin Maryam tumhare darmiyan insaf wale hakim kar utarane wale hain; suar ko qatl karenge, saleeb torenge, jizya rakhenge; maal bahegaa yahan tak ke koi use na legaa."
"2422","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne bhai par Musalman ka haq paanch hain; salam ka jawab, beemar ki iyadat, janaze ke peeche chalna, dawat qabool karna, chheenkne wale ko Yarhamukallah kahanaa."
"2423","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Far' nahin, atiiraa nahin Sa'id ne kaha: Far' pehla bachcha hai jo paida ho, use woh apne buton ke liye zabah karte the; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen us se mana kiya atiiraa Muzar ki Rajab mein zabeehe hai; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen us se mana kiya"
"2424","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas the ke farmaya: Tumhare bhai Najashi mar gae; khade ho aur un par namaz padho unhon ne kaha: Woh uthe aur ham un ke sath uthe yahan tak ke Baqi' pahunche to aage ho aur hamen peeche saf banaya, aur un par chaar takbiren kahin"
"2425","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id bin Musayyab aur Abu Salamah Rahman Abd se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Hudhail ki do aurton mein se ek ne doosri ko pathar mara aur use-pet ke bachche ko qatl kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ummiyah, aur Aap ne us ke janiina mein ghurran muqarrar kiya, ghulam ya laundi; aur aurat ki diyat us ki baraadarii par faisla ki; use-us ke ladke ko aur un ke sath walon ko waris banaya to Huzali aae bin Nabighah aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya woh jurmana de Jis ne na khaya-piya, na kaha-roya; Kya us ka jaisa batil hai?! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh kahinon ke bhaiyon mein se hai, us ki tukabandii ki wajah se jo Us ne kahi"
"2426","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id aur Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sakht garmi jahannam ki bhaap se hai; namaz thandi karke padho"
"2427","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id ya doosre se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Sab bura khana waleeme ka khana hai; us mein ameer bulaye jate hain, ghareeb chhore jate hain jo dawat qabool na kare, Us ne Allah-Rasulullah ki nafarmani ki"
"2428","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Musalman ke teen bachche na hon ke use aag chhue, siwae qasam poori hone ke Zuhri ne kaha: Goya woh yeh aayat chahte hain: {Tum se koi nahin magar us mein pesh hoga} aayat"
"2429","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bezubaana janwar ka zakhm bezamaanata hai, khadaana bezamaanata hai, kunwan bezamaanata hai, dafiine mein panchwan hai"
"2430","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chand dekhne roza rakho, chand dekhne iftar karo; agar badal ho to tees gino."
"2431","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq se Ma'mar bin Rashid aur Sufyan bin Husain se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se — Shu'bah ne kaha: Mein se ek ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Far' nahin, atiiraa nahin doosre ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Far'-atiiraa se mana kiya"
"2432","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Allah ne Yahood par lanat ki — ya: Allah Yahood se lade — un par charbi haram hui, lekin Unhon ne use bechi aur us ki qeemat karega"
"2433","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Aey Hassan, Rasulullah ki taraf se jawab do; Aey Allah, Roohul-qudusa se un ki taaiida karo"
"2434","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Tau'mah ke aazad-karda Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne masjid mein miyyat par namaz padhi, us ke liye kuch nahin Salih ne kaha: Main ne un mardon ko paya jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr ko pae the; jab woh aate aur masjid mein padhne ke siwa na pate to lautte aur na padhte the"
"2435","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi qaum majlis mein nahin baithe jis mein Allah ka zikr na kare aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par salat na padhe, magar woh un par hasrat hogi"
"2436","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajjat-wa'da mein apni biwiyon se farmaya: Yahi Hajj hai, phir kapde par rehna hai unhon ne kaha: Woh sab safar karti thin siwae Zainab-Saudah ke; unhon ne kaha: Hamari sawari na hilegii, jabase Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna"
"2437","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke bazu wale the, kandhon mein kushadgi wale the, lambi palaka wale the; bazaar mein shora karne wale na the, na fahasha the na ghaflat the; poori tarah mudte the, poori tarah phirate the"
"2438","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo miyyat nahalaae woh ghusl kare; jo janaza uthae woh wuzu kare"
"2439","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin Maqburi Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall chheenk ko pasand karta hai aur jamahi ko napasand karta hai jab tum se ek chheenke to kahe: Allah; sunne wale par wajib hai ke kahe: Yarahamukallaaha. jab jamahi aae to shaitan hanse; jitna ho sake use chipaae."
"2440","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Musalman aurton, padosan padosan ko haqeer na samjhe, chahe bakri ke khur se"
"2441","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah-aakhirat par iman rakhne wali aurat ke liye jaiz nahin ke mahram ke baghair ek din safar kare"
"2442","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sabaa-masaanii Fatiha hai"
"2443","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do rak'aten padhin phir salam phera to kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, Kya namaz chhoti hui ya Aap bhool? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Na chhoti hui na bhuulaa. to qaum ne kaha: Kyun nahin, Aey Allah ke farmaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae aur do rak'aten padhin, phir do sajde kiye"
"2444","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ka sab jaanakaara hun Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab ruku se sar uthate to kehte the: Aey Allah, Aey hamare Rabb, Tere liye tareef hai do sajdon ke darmiyan takbir kehte the, jab uthte aur jhukte the"
"2445","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke paas apne bhai ka zulm ho; us ki izzat ya maal mein se, woh use ada kare is se pahle ke us ke paas qayamat ka din aae, jis mein dinar-dirham qabool na hoga agar us ki neki ho to us mein se li jaegi aur us ke sathi ko di jaegi; agar us ki neki na ho to us ke sathi ki burayi mein se li jaegi aur us par laadii jayegi"
"2446","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum se kisi ko us ka amal nijaat na dega unhon ne kaha: Aap bhi nahin, Ya Rasulullah? Farmaya: Main bhi nahin, siwae is ke ke Allah mujhe apni rehmat se dhaanpe. seedhe-qareeb raho — ya: Qareeb raho — Sham-subah chalo, raat ka hissa lo; darmiyan ki raah, darmiyan ki raah, pahuncoge."
"2447","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: Aey Allah, main Teri panah mangta hun bekaara ilm se, na utarne wale dil se, na hai wale nafs se, na suni jane wali dua se"
"2448","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ma'shar ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar gharon mein aurat-bachche na hote to main hukm deta jo namaz ki azan de — ya'ni aakhri Isha ki namaz — phir un logon par jalata jo namaz se peeche rehte hain — ya'ni aakhri Isha ki namaz — un ke gharon mein"
"2449","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtar aurat woh hai jise jab dekho to woh tumhen khush kare; jab use hukm do to tumhen mane; jab us se ghaaiba ho to apni jaan-maal mein tumhari hifazat kare unhon ne kaha: Yeh aayat padhi: {Mard aurton par hakim hain} aayat ke aakhir tak"
"2450","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ma'shar ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Dajjal ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Koi Nabi nahin magar Us ne Dajjal se apni ummat ko daraya — ya kaha: Dajjal se apni ummat ko Khabardar kiya Khabardar, main tum woh kahunga jo mujh se pahle kisi Nabi ne na kaha: Woh kana hai; tumhara Rabb Tabaraka-Ta'ala aisa nahin hai; us ki donon aankhon ke darmiyan likha hai: Kaafira."
"2451","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umari ne ham se bayan kiya, Maqburi Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us par raham kare jis ke-bhai ke darmiyan izzat-maal ka zulm ho aur woh use is se pahle ada kare ke us par woh din aae jis mein dinar-dirham qabool na hoga agar us ki neki ho to us mein se li jaegi aur zulm wale ko di jaegi; agar us ki neki na ho to us ke sathi ki burayi mein se li jaegi aur us par laadii jayegi to Sa'id ke paas ek shaikh ne kaha: Kya Tum ne Abu Hurairah ko is hadees mein kuch karte nahin suna? To unhon ne kaha: Nahin to shaikh ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah ko is hadees mein karte suna ke use kaha jata hai: Yeh muflis hai"
"2452","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ma'shar ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log Jahiliyat ka fakhr zaroor karenge, ya Allah Azza-wa Jall ke han gubarailon se haqeer honge"
"2453","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar apni ummat par mashaqqat na hoti to unhen har namaz par wuzu ka hukm deta, har wuzu ke sath miswak ka hukm deta, aur Isha ko aadhi raat tak karta"
"2454","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umari ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maqburi Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Dehati aaya yahan tak ke masjid pahunchi, masjid ke darwaze par sawari bandhin, phir masjid mein dakhil hua aur kaha: Tum se kaun — ya kaha: Kya tum Abdul-Muttalib ka beta hai? — Ya'ni Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam). to unhon ne kaha: Woh gore hain, tek lagae hain to us ne kaha: Aey Muhammad, main tum sawal karta hun aur sawal sakht karta hun tum poochta hun tum pahle walon ke Rabb ki qasam, tumhare baad aane walon ke Rabb ki qasam, Kya Allah Azza-wa Jall ne tumhen bheja? Farmaya: Ji Han us ne kaha: Tumhen usi ki qasam de poochta hun, Kya usi ne tumhen hukm diya ke din-raat mein paanch namazen padho? Farmaya: Ji Han us ne kaha: Tumhen usi ki qasam de poochta hun, Kya usi ne tumhen hukm diya ke barah mahine mein se ek Maheena roza rakho? Farmaya: Ji Han us ne kaha: Tumhen usi ki qasam de poochta hun, Kya usi ne tumhen hukm diya ke Bait ka Hajj karo? Farmaya: Ji Han us ne kaha: Tumhen usi ki qasam de poochta hun, Kya usi ne tumhen hukm diya ke hamare daron se lekar hamare miskeenon ko do? Farmaya: Ji Han us ne kaha: Main tum par iman laya aur tumhari sach ki; main apni qaum mein se peeche walon ka numaaindaa hun, main Sa'labah ka beta zimaama hun rahi yeh chhoti-mota baat, ham unhen Jahiliyat mein izzat se chhodte the unhon ne kaha: Umar kehte bin Khattab the: Main ne zimaama bin Sa'labah se mukhtasar aadmi nahin dekha"
"2455","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ma'shar ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mazloom ki dua qabool hai, chahe woh badkar ho; us ki burai usi par hai"
"2456","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Suraj nikalne ka behtar din Juma hai; Allah Azza-wa Jall ne hamen us ki hidayat di, logon ko us se gumrah kiya hamara Juma hai, Yahood ka Hafta hai, Nasara ka Itwar hai us mein ghadi hai — ya'ni Jume mein, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) use hath se kam karte hain — jis mein banda namaz padhte bhalai mange to use milegi"
"2457","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Yaman Huzaifah ne ham se bayan kiya, Talha bin Abu Usman se, Maqburi Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Jo khane par bin bulaye dakhil hua, woh fasiq dakhil hua, haram khaya sab bura khana waleeme ka khana hai; ameer bulaye jate hain, ghareeb chhore jate hain jo dawat qabool na kare, Us ne Allah Azza-wa Jall aur us ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki nafarmani ki"
"2458","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ma'shar ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hadiya do; hadiya seene ki ranjisha le jata hai padosan padosan ko haqeer na samjhe, chahe bakri ke aadhe khur se"
"2459","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umari ne ham se bayan kiya: Maqburi Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Hurairah se, ke ek aadmi Musalman hua aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use ghusl ka hukm diya"
"2460","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Maqburi Sa'id se, Sa'id bin Yasar se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi banda namaz-zikr ke liye masjid aabad nahin karta magar Allah Azza-wa Jall us se khush hota hai jab woh gharwalon se nikle, jaise ghaaiba ke ghar apne ghaaiba se khush hote hain"
"2461","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fulaih ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd Abdullah bin Rahman se, Sa'id bin Yasar se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Allah Tabaraka-Ta'ala qayamat ke din farmata hai: Meri izzat mein muhabbat karne wale kahan hain? Aaj unhen apne barabar mein basaunga, jis din mere barabar ke siwa koi saya nahin"
"2462","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id se, Abd bin Abu Hurairah ke aazad-karda Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ne wasiyat ki: Jab main chahun to mujh par khema na lagao, mere peeche aag na lao, mujhe jaldi le chalo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Mo'min jab takht par rakha jae to kehta hai: Mujhe aage karo, mujhe aage karo; kafir jab takht par rakha jae to kehta hai: Hae use, use kahan le ja rahe ho"
"2463","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd Haris bin Rahman se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo sharab piye use kode lagao; phir aae to kode lagao; phir aae to kode lagao; phir chauthi martaba aae to qatl karo"
"2464","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Mo'min jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein wafat pata aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laya jata to poochte the: Kya us par qarz hai? Agar kehte: Ji Han farmate: Kya Us ne apne qarz ki wafa chhodi hai? Agar kehte: Ji Han us par namaz padhte the; agar kehte: Nahin farmate: Apne sathi par padho jab Allah Azza-wa Jall ne hamen fath din to farmaya: Main momineen ka un se zyada haqdar hun; jo qarz chhore woh mujh par hai, jo maal chhore woh waris ka hai"
"2465","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz khadi ho to chalo aur tum par itminan ho; jo pao padho, jo se us ki qaza karo"
"2466","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya se, Abu Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ko {jab aasman phategaa} mein sajdah karte dekha to main ne kaha: Kya Main ne tumhen us mein sajdah karte nahin dekha, Abu Aey Hurairah? To unhon ne kaha: Agar Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko us mein sajdah karte na dekha hota to sajdah na karta"
"2467","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Abu Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum se ek tamanna kare to ghaura kare Kya tamanna karta hai; woh nahin janta us ki tamanna mein se us ke liye Kya likha jayega"
"2468","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen, sab Musalman par farz hain: Beemar ki iyadat, chheenkne wale ko Yarhamukallah jab woh Allah kahe, janaze ke peeche mein"
"2469","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab ghulam chori kare to use becho, chahe nash mein"
"2470","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fitna hoga; us mein soya jagte se behtar hoga, chalne wala daurane wale se behtar hoga, baitha khade se behtar hoga, khada chalne wale se behtar hoga jo us mein panah-amaana pae, us se bachao"
"2471","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz ki azan di jae to shaitan goza marte hue bhagta hai yahan tak ke azan na sune jab azan poori ho to aata hai; jab iqamat kahi jae to bhagta hai; jab iqamat poori ho to aata hai yahan tak ke aadmi-nafs ke darmiyan vasavasaa karta hai, yahan tak ke kehta hai: Woh yaad kar, woh yaad kar — jo na yaad kiya tha jab koi na jane Us ne kitni padhin; teen ya chaar, to baithe do sajde kare"
"2472","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Abu Salamah aur Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Hudhail ki do aurton mein se ek ne doosri ko pathar mara aur use-pet ke bachche ko qatl kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ummiyah, aur Aap ne us ke janiina mein ghurran muqarrar kiya, ghulam ya laundi; aur aurat ki diyat us ki baraadarii par faisla ki; use-us ke ladke ko aur un ke sath walon ko waris banaya to Huzali aae bin Nabighah aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya woh jurmana de Jis ne na khaya-piya, na kaha-roya; Kya us ka jaisa batil hai! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh kahinon ke bhaiyon mein se hai, us ki tukabandii ki wajah se jo Us ne kahi"
"2473","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Abu Salamah aur Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah-aakhirat par iman rakhta hai, woh apne padosi ki izzat kare; jo Allah-aakhirat par iman rakhta hai, woh achchi baat kahe ya khamosh rahe; jo Allah-aakhirat par iman rakhta hai, woh apne mehmaan ki izzat kare"
"2474","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum pahle pichhli nabiyon mein log the jise baat ki jati thin; agar meri ummat mein mein se koi ho to woh Umar hai"
"2475","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qabr ke azab, aag ke azab, jiivana-maut ki aazmaish aur Masih-Dajjal ki burayi se panah mangte the"
"2476","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Itminan ke sath aao; jo pao padho, jo se us ki qaza karo"
"2477","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah ya A'ishah se — Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shak mujh se nahin hai — ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Taqat bhar amal lo"
"2478","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Abu Salamah aur bin Musayyab se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sakht garmi jahannam ki bhaap se hai; namaz thandi karke padho"
"2479","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zuhr ki do rak'aten padhin phir salam phera to un se kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, Kya namaz chhoti hui? Aur Aap khabar jo Aap ne kiya to do rak'aten padhin phir do sajde kiye"
"2480","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek aadmi gae par sawar tha ke us ne kaha: Main is ke liye paida nahin hua; main to Hal ke liye paida hua to main is par iman laya, main, Abu Bakr-Umar Abu Salamah ne kaha: Woh us din qaum mein hazir na the unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek aadmi apni bakriyan caraa raha tha ke bhediya aaya aur mein se bakri li; Us ne us se chiinii. to us ne kaha: Sabua ke din Tu us ke sath Kya karega, jis din us ke liye mere siwa koi charwaha na hoga to main is par iman laya, main, Abu Bakr-Umar Abu Salamah ne kaha: Woh us din qaum mein na the"
"2481","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne khwab mein dekha, log mujh par pesh kiye jate hain, un par Qameezen hain; kuch Qameezen yahan tak, kuch Qameezen wahan tak mere paas se Umar guzre, apni qamees ghaseette hue to kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, Tum ne us ki Kya use ki? Farmaya: Deen ki"
"2482","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salamah bin Kuhail se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah Auf Rahman Abd ko Mina mein suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, ke dehati ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se apne qarz ka taqaza kiya jo us par tha, aur un se sakhti ki to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba us par hamla karne lage to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use chhodo; haq wale ki baat hoti hai phir farmaya: Use ada karo to unhon ne kaha: Hamen us ki umar se behtar ke siwa nahin milti farmaya: Use khareedo aur do; tum behtar woh hai jo adayegi mein behtar hai"
"2483","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Umar bin Abu Salamah se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah qabron ki ziyarat karne wali aurton par lanat kare"
"2484","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall ghairat karta hai, mo'min ghairat karta hai; Allah Azza-wa Jall ki ghairat hai ke mo'min woh kare jo us par haram kiya gaya"
"2485","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har bachcha fitrat par paida hota hai; phir us ke walidain use Yahudi-Nasrani-Majoosi banate hain Kya Tum ne janwar ko nahin dekha, janwar janataa hai; us mein kaanaakatii Kya dekhte ho?."
"2486","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Ramazan roza rakhe iman-sawab ke sath, us ke pichhle gunah bakhshe jaenge; jo shab-Qadr qiyam kare iman-sawab ke sath, us ke pichhle gunah bakhshe jayenge"
"2487","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ramazan se ek-do din roze se pahle na karo, siwae is ke ke koi aadmi roza rakhne ka qadeem ho, woh use rakhe"
"2488","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Amr se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Suraj nikalne ka behtar din Juma hai; us mein Adam paida hue, us mein qayamat hogi, us mein ghadi hai jis mein banda namaz padhte Allah Azza-wa Jall se bhalai mange to Allah use dega aur use thodi batayi, hath se aise kaha ke woh thodi hai"
"2489","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais bin Sa'd se, Muhammad bin Qurashi Ibrahim se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Sham aaya aur Ka'b se mila main unhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karta tha, woh mujhe Taurat se bayan karte the, yahan tak ke Ham ne Jume ka zikr kiya to Main ne unhen bayan kiya ke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jume mein ghadi hai jis mein Musalman Allah se bhalai mange to woh use dega ya dega to Ka'b ne kaha: Allah-Rasulullah ne sach kaha; har saal mein ek martaba? Main ne kaha: Nahin unhon ne kaha: Har mahine mein ek martaba? Main ne kaha: Nahin unhon ne kaha: Har Jume mein ek martaba? Main ne kaha: Ji Han Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Main Madinah aaya aur Abdullah bin salam se mila, aur unhen khabar ke main Ka'b se mila tha main unhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karta tha, woh mujhe Taurat se bayan karte the, yahan tak ke Ham ne Jume ka zikr kiya, aur unhen woh khabar jo Ka'b ne kaha tha: Allah-Rasulullah ne sach kaha; har saal mein ek martaba to unhon ne kaha: Ka'b ne jhoot farmaya main ne kaha: Woh aae hain to unhon ne kaha: Tum jante ho woh kaun-si ghadi hai? Main ne kaha: Nahin, aur un par toot pada: Mujhe batao, mujhe woh to unhon ne kaha: Woh Asr-Maghrib ke darmiyan hai main ne kaha: Kaise, jabke namaz nahin hai? To unhon ne kaha: Kya Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate nahin suna: Banda namaz mein rehta hai jab tak namaz ka intezar kare; farishte kehte hain: Aey Allah, use bakhshish de; Aey Allah, us par raham kar?."
"2490","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ishaq se, Muhammad bin Qurashi Ibrahim se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Jume ke din ghusl kare, miswak kare, apne behtar kapde pahne, ghar ki khushbu lagae, phir masjid aae aur logon ki gardan na phalaange, namaz padhe; jab imam nikle to khamosh rahe, us ke liye agle Jume tak ka kaffara hoga"
"2491","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Amr se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jume ke din khutba de rahe the ke Abu Zarr ne Ubayy bin Ka'b se kaha: Yeh Surah kab nazil hui? To Unhon ne jawab na diya jab Aap namaz se farigh hue to un se kaha: tumhari namaz mein se tumhen sirf behuudagii hulla to Abu Nabi Zarr (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur Aap se is ka zikr kiya, to farmaya: Ubayy ne sach kaha"
"2492","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aziz bin Abu Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Fazl se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke ambiya mein farq na karo — ya: Ambiya ke tak"
"2493","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Ajlan se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rozedar kar bura na do; agar khade ho to baithe jao meri jaan ki qasam, rozedar ke munh ki bu Allah Azza-wa Jall ke han mushk ki khushbu se pakeezah hai"
"2494","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Ajlan se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko qurbani ka oont hankate dekha aur farmaya: Us par sawar ho to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, woh qurbani ka oont hai! Farmaya: Us par sawar ho, afsos tum par!."
"2495","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Ajlan se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghulam tumhara bhai hai; jab tumhare liye khana banae to use apne sath baithaao. agar inkar kare to use khilao; un ke chehron par na maro"
"2496","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Waleed ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab logon ki imamat karo to halki parhaao; mein chhota-bada-kamzor hain"
"2497","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Waleed se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Miskeen woh nahin jise ek-do luqme wapas den; miskeen daman hai jo logon se cipakakara na maange."
"2498","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Waleed se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe khush nahin ke mere paas Uhud bhar Sona ho, marte dam mere paas us mein se dinar ho, siwae is ke ke qarz ke liye rakh choduun."
"2499","[AI-translation] Yunus ne, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin mushamailla ke aazad-karda Samaan ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ko Abu Qatadah se bayan karte suna, jabke woh Bait ka tawaf kar rahe the: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rukn-maqam ke darmiyan ek aadmi ki bai'at hogi; is ghar ko sab pahle us ke ghar haram thaharaaenge; jab woh use haram thaharaaen to Arab ki halakat na poocho phir Habsha aayenge aur use viiraana karenge, aisi viiraanii jis ke baad aabad na hoga; Wahy us ka khazana nikaalenge."
"2500","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Samaan se, unhon ne kaha: Abu zuraqiyon Hurairah ki masjid mein hamare paas aae aur kaha: Logon ne teen chhore jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) karte the jab namaz mein dakhil hote to hath phailaakara uthate, phir thodi der rukte, Allah Azza-wa Jall se us ka Fazl mangte the aur takbir kehte the jab jhukte-uthte aur jab ruku karte the"
"2501","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nafi' bin Abu Nafi' ne hamen khabar, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Baazii-shart sirf oont ki erii, ghode ke khur ya teer ki nok mein hai"
"2502","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu mutamira ne mujhe bayan kiya, Umar bin Khaldah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Abu Hurairah ke paas apne ek sathi ke bare mein aae jo museebat hua — ya'ni diwaliya hua — aur ek aadmi ne us ke paas apna saaman paya Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Yeh woh hai jis mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla kiya ke jo diwaliya ho ya mar jae, aur aadmi us ke paas apna saaman pae, woh us ka zyada haqdar hai, siwae is ke ke aadmi wafa chhod"
"2503","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Abd Umar bin Aziz se, Ibrahim bin Abdullah bin Qariz se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ko hamari chhat par wuzu karte dekha, aur main ne kaha: Abu Aey Hurairah, kis se wuzu karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Paneer ke phir se jo khae; Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Wuzu us se hai jise aag lagi ho"
"2504","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aziz bin Abu Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Hashimi Fazl se, Araz se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke talbiyaa mein se tha: Labbaik sachche maabuuda."
"2505","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Abd bin Araz Rahman ko suna — Shu'bah ne kaha: Main use Abu sirf Hurairah se janta hun — ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ansar-Quraish, Muzainah, Juhainah, Ghifar, Aslam aur ashjaaa ek-doosre ke haleef hain; Allah-Rasulullah ke siwa un ka koi haleef nahin"
"2506","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abd bin Araz Rahman se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jume ke din Fajr ki namaz mein (Alif-Lam-Meem Tanzeel) aur (Hal Ata) padhte the"
"2507","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zinad ne ham se bayan kiya — Yunus ne kaha: Mera khayal hai apne walid se — Araz se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Log is mamle mein Quraish ke taabea hain; un ke Musalman un ke Musalmanon ke taabea hain, un ke kafir un ke kafiron ke taabea hain"
"2508","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair bin Muhammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Aslam se, Araz, Busr bin Sa'id aur Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne Asr ki do rak'aten ya ek rak'at suraj doobne se pahle pa, us ki fauta nahin hui Jis ne Fajr ki ek rak'at suraj nikalne se pahle pa, us ki fauta nahin hui"
"2509","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ata bin Laisi Yazid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mushrikon ke bachchon ke bare mein poocha gaya, to farmaya: Allah jane woh Kya karte"
"2510","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ata bin Laisi Yazid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya ham qayamat ke din apne Rabb ko dekhenge? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum suraj ko dekhne mein nuqsan uthate ho jis mein badal na hon? Kya tum chaudveen raat ke chand ko dekhne mein nuqsan uthate ho? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin farmaya: Isi hi use dekhoge."
"2511","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Abu Agarr Muslim se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jume ke din farishte masjid ke darwaze par khade hote hain, pahle-pahle ko likhte hain jaldi aane wala goya oont dene wala hai, us ke baad wala goya gae dene wala hai, us ke baad wala goya mendha dene wala hai, us ke baad wala goya murghi dene wala hai, us ke baad wala goya anda dene wala hai jab imam mimbar par baithe to saheefe samete jate hain, woh baithte hain aur zikr sunte hain"
"2512","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Agarr ko kehte suna: Main Abu Hurairah aur Abu Sa'id Khudri par gawahi deta hun ke Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par gawahi di, farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall mohlat deta hai yahan tak ke teesri raat guzar jae, phir utarta hai aur farmata hai: Koi mangne wala hai? Koi Tauba karne wala hai? Koi gunah se mu'afi mangne wala hai? Ek aadmi ne un se kaha: Fajr nikalne tak? Farmaya: Ji Han"
"2513","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Agarr se, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Hurairah aur Abu Sa'id par gawahi deta hun ke Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par gawahi di, farmaya: Koi qaum Allah Azza-wa Jall ka zikr karte nahin baithe magar farishte unhen gher lete hain, rehmat unhen dhank leti hai, un par sakiinaa utarti hai, aur Allah Azza-wa Jall un ka zikr apne paas walon mein karta hai"
"2514","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad aur Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin Sa'ib se, Abu Agarr Muslim se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Allah Tabaraka-Ta'ala farmata hai: Takabbur mera tehband hai, kibriyaaii meri chadar hai; jo mujh se mein se ek mein ummiyah, use jahannam mein phenkunga"
"2515","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Amir ne ham se bayan kiya, Amir bin Sa'd se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas se janaza guzra aur Unhon ne us ki achchi tareef ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wajib hui phir doosra janaza guzra aur Unhon ne us ki buri tareef ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wajib hui aur farmaya: Tum se kuch ek-doosre par gawah ho"
"2516","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu jauzaa se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab mo'min bande ki rooh qabz ho to rehmat ke farishte aate hain aur us ki jaan safed resham mein nikalte hain kehte hain: Ham ne is se pakeezah khushbu nahin paya to use nikalte hain aur kehte hain: Narmi karo; woh duniya ke ghum se nikla hai to kehte hain: Falan ne Kya kiya? Falan ne Kya kiya? Farmaya: Raha kafir, us ki rooh nikalti hai, aur zameen ke daaroghaa kehte hain: Ham ne is se badbudar khushbu nahin paya to use neeche zameen ki taraf utara jata hai"
"2517","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Umar bin Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mo'min ki rooh us ke qarz se latki hai yahan tak ke us ki taraf se ada ho"
"2518","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Umar bin Abu Salamah se — ya Abu Salamah se, Abu Dawud ko shak hua — Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat mein qaum dakhil hongi jin ke dil parindon jaise hain"
"2519","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Jurairi Abbas se, Abu Nahdi Usman se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Mere dost ne mujhe teen ki wasiyat ki: Mahine mein teen din roza, sone se pahle witr, Chasht ki namaz"
"2520","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Bunani Sabit se, Abu Usman se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Abu Hurairah ke sath safar mein the; khana hazir hua to Ham ne Abu Hurairah ki taraf bheja jabke woh namaz padh rahe the qasid aaya aur khabar ke woh rozedar hain khana khane ke liye rakha gaya Abu aae Hurairah jabke woh us se farigh hone wale the to us mein se liya aur khane lage qasid ki taraf dekhne lage jise Abu Unhon ne Hurairah ki taraf bheja tha, to us ne kaha: Mujhe Kya dekhte ho? Allah ki qasam, Us ne mujhe khabar ke woh rozedar hai unhon ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha phir Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Sabr ke mahine ka roza aur har mahine teen din ka roza saal bhar ka roza hai main Allah ke zyada karne mein rozedar hun, us ki aasani mein iftar karne wala hun"
"2521","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Alqamah bin Marsad se, Abu Rabi' se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki dua mein se thi: Aey Allah, mujhe muaf kar jo Main ne aage kiya aur jo peeche kiya, jo chhipaya aur jo zahir kiya, meri ziyadti, aur jo Tu mujh se zyada janta hai; Tu aage karne wala aur peeche karne wala hai; Tere siwa koi ma'bood nahin"
"2522","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Alqamah bin Hazrami Marsad se, Abu Rabi' se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jahiliyat ki chaar baat log kabhi na karenge: Nasab mein taan, miyyat par nauha, sitare se baarish, chuuta. khujli wale oont ne sau oonton ko khujli lagai; pahle oont ko Kis ne khujli lagai?."
"2523","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Abu Rabi' se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Mere dost ne mujhe teen ki wasiyat ki: Witr par hi souun, Chasht ki namaz, mahine mein teen din rozaa."
"2524","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Shahr bin Haushab se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se log baithe aur yeh aayat zikr ki: {Zameen ke upar se nas se ukhaarii, use baqi nahin}. to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham use bhuphora samajhte hain to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bhuphora manna mein se hai, us ka pani aankh ki shifa hai; ajavaa jannat se hai, woh zehr ki shifa hai"
"2525","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd bin Hakam bin Zakwan ne ham se bayan kiya, Shahr bin Haushab se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Badtareen darje walon mein se hai Jis ne doosre ki duniya se apni aakhirat par ki"
"2526","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Zakwan Salih ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Tasbih mardon ke liye hai, tali aurton ke liye hai, namaz mein"
"2527","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi namaz mein hai jab tak namaz use roke."
"2528","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha gaya us bare mein jo aadmi apne dil mein socataa hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh khalis iman hai"
"2529","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail bin Abu Salih se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Iman ki sattar se zyada tehniyan hain; sab afzal laailaahaa-illalaaha kehna hai"
"2530","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail bin Abu Salih se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Amal Peer-Jumairat ko pesh hote hain; jo Allah se shirk na kare use bakhsha jata hai, siwae us aadmi ke jis ke-bhai ke darmiyan dushmani ho; kaha jata hai: In donon ko chhodo yahan tak ke sulah karen"
"2531","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaayadaa ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imam zamanat hai, mu'azzin ameen hai Aey Allah, Khamsa ko hidayat de, muazzinon ko bakhshish de"
"2532","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail bin Abu Salih se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beta baap ka badla na dega siwae is ke ke use ghulam pae aur aazad kare"
"2533","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum se jo Jume ke baad namaz padhe, woh chaar rak'aten padhe"
"2534","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail bin Abu Salih se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum shaheed kise kehte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki raah mein qatl hone chhae to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Waqt meri ummat ke shaheed kam honge jo Allah ki raah mein qatl ho woh shaheed hai, jo Allah ki raah mein mare woh shaheed hai, taoon wala shaheed hai, pet ki beemari wala shaheed hai Suhail ne kaha: Ubaidullah bin Miqsam ne mujhe apne walid se bayan kiya — Main ne us se nahin suna — ke Us ne is hadees mein badhaya: Dooba hua"
"2535","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mardon ki behtar saf pehli hai, badtareen aakhri hai; aurton ki behtar saf aakhri hai, badtareen pehli hai"
"2536","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne lakdi-roghan se mana kiya to Abu Hurairah se kaha gaya: Lakdi Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Sabz matakiyaan."
"2537","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne balisht bhar zameen haq li, use saat zameenon se tauq pahnaya jayega"
"2538","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne bakri ka kandhe khaya, phir kulli ki, hath dhoya aur namaz padhi"
"2539","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salih ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ki jama'at ki namaz us ki bazaar-ghar ki namaz se bees se zyada darje rakhti hai"
"2540","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: A'mash ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salih ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rozedar ke munh ki bu Allah ke han mushk ki khushbu se pakeezah hai"
"2541","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Zakwan ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jab aadmi wuzu kare aur achcha wuzu kare, phir namaz ke liye nikle, use sirf Wahy nikale — ya: Use sirf Wahy ubhaare — to koi qadam na uthaaegaa magar Allah Azza-wa Jall us se us ka darja barhaaegaa, ya us se gunah hataaegaa."
"2542","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Zakwan se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Farishte tum se ek par salat padhte hain jab tak woh apne musalle mein rahe, jab tak hadas na kare; kehte hain: Aey Allah, use bakhshish de; Aey Allah, us par raham karo"
"2543","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Zakwan se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo lohe se khudakushii kare, us ka loha us ke hath mein hoga, qayamat ke din jahannam ki aag mein us se apna pet godegaa, hamesha-hamesha jata jo zehr se khudakushii kare, us ka zehr us ke hath mein hoga, jahannam ki aag mein use ghoont-ghoont piye, hamesha-hamesha jata jo pahaad se kar khudakushii kare, woh jahannam ki aag mein lurhakataa rahega, hamesha-hamesha jata"
"2544","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: A'mash ne ham se bayan kiya, Zakwan se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jab kutta tum se ek ke bartan mein dale to use saat martaba dhoo."
"2545","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: A'mash ne mujhe khabar di, Zakwan se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jab tum se ek neend se jage to bartan mein hath na duboe yahan tak ke us par ek-do lapen phenke; woh nahin janta us ka hath kahan raha"
"2546","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Husain se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho, meri kuniyat par kuniyat na rakho"
"2547","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Husain se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne mujhe khwab mein dekha, Us ne mujhe bedaarii mein dekha; shaitan meri surat nahin banata — Shu'bah ne kaha: Meri surat mein khayal nahin banata"
"2548","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Husain se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, Shu'bah ne kaha: Mera khayal hai Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jis ne mujh par jaan jhoot bandha, woh jahannam mein apna guzarne bana"
"2549","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail bin Abu Salih se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Awaz-hawa ke siwa wuzu nahin"
"2550","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, sumayya se, sumayya se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek umrah se doosre umrah tak darmiyan ke gunahon ka kaffara hai; maqbool Hajj ka sila sirf jannat hai"
"2551","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail bin Abu Salih se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya Ahle-Kitab ke bare mein: Unhen salam mein pehal na karo; jab raste mein milo to unhen tang hisse ki taraf karo"
"2552","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umari ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr ke aazad-karda sumayya se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Umrah apne-agle umrah ke darmiyan ka kaffara hai; maqbool Hajj ka sila sirf jannat hai"
"2553","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ya Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qaum mein baghair ijazat jhanke, unhen us ki aankh phoranaa jaiz hai"
"2554","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ya Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah bande ka parda nahin rakhta magar Allah Azza-wa Jall qayamat ke din us par parda rakhega"
"2555","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail bin Abu Salih se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qahat yeh nahin ke saal bhar baarish na ho; qahat yeh hai ke aasman barase aur zameen na ugaae."
"2556","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Badr ka din hua to log ghanimat ki taraf lapke aur use hasil kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghanimat tumhare siwa siyahi sar walon mein se kisi ke liye halal na hui Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Aap sahaba jab ghanimat hasil karte to use jama karte, aasman se aag utarti aur use kha jati to Allah ne yeh aayat nazil ki: {Agar Allah ki taraf se pahle Kitab na hoti} do aayaton ke aakhir tak"
"2557","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Sa'id Sinan Sinan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Habib bin Abu Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, aadmi kar amal karta hai, phir jab woh zahir ho to woh use khush kare aur pasand aaye to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ke liye do ajr hain; elaan ka ajr aur poshiidaa ka ajra. Abu Bishr ne kaha: Abu Ubaid se zikr kiya gaya ke use khushi hui ke us ka koi bura amal zahir na ho"
"2558","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya: Suhail bin Abu Salih ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne Asr ki do rak'aten — ya ek rak'at, Abu shak Bishr se hai — suraj doobne se pahle padhin, Us ne paya Jis ne Fajr ki ek rak'at suraj nikalne se pahle pa, Us ne paya"
"2559","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne mere ameer ki ita'at ki, Us ne meri ita'at ki; Jis ne mere ameer ki nafarmani ki, Us ne meri nafarmani ki"
"2560","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har bachcha fitrat par paida hota hai; phir us ke walidain use Yahudi-Nasrani-mushrik banate hain"
"2561","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail bin Abu Salih se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke phirne wale neaaka farishte hain, zikr ki majlis talash karte hain jab woh Allah Azza-wa Jall ka zikr karti qaum par aate hain to baithte hain aur unhen paron se saya dete hain, un ke-duniya ke aasman ke tak jab woh uthte hain to apne Rabb ki taraf carhate hain to Tabaraka-Ta'ala farmata hai, woh zyada janta hai: Kahan se aae? To kehte hain: Tere bandon ke paas se aae jo Teri tasbih karte hain, Teri tareef karte hain, Teri tahlil karte hain, Teri takbir kehte hain, Tere azab se Teri panah mangte hain, Teri jannat mangte hain to Tabaraka-Ta'ala farmata hai: Kya Unhon ne meri jannat-jahannam dekhi? To kehte hain: Nahin to farmata hai: Kaise, agar woh donon dekhte to? Main ne unhen panah di jis se Unhon ne panah mangi, unhen diya jo Unhon ne manga to kaha jata hai: Mein ek aadmi hai jo un par se guzra aur un ke sath baitha to farmata hai: Use bhi muaf kiya; woh aise log hain jin ka hamanashiin kisi nahin hota"
"2562","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail bin Abu Salih se, Safwan bin Sulaim se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo baghair uzr musalsal teen Jume chhore, Allah us ke dil par mohar lagaaegaa."
"2563","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall jab bande se muhabbat kare to Jibreel ko pukare aur bheje: Aey Jibreel, main falan se muhabbat karta hun, tum us se muhabbat karo to Jibreel us se muhabbat karte hain aur aasman mein pukarta hain: Allah falan se muhabbat karta hai, us se muhabbat karo unhon ne kaha: Aasman wale us se muhabbat karte hain aur us ke liye zameen mein maqabuuliyata rakhi jati hai jab bande se nafrat kare to isi hi hota hai"
"2564","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghodon ki peshaaniyon mein qayamat tak bhalai hui hai"
"2565","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jo kahe: Log halaak hue, woh mein sab halaak hai"
"2566","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Musalman ki museebat kushaada kare, Allah qayamat ke din aakhirat ki halakat mein se museebat kushaada karega jo Musalman par aasani kare, Allah us par duniya-aakhirat mein aasani karega jo duniya mein Musalman par parda phenke, Allah us par duniya-aakhirat mein parda daalegaa. Allah Azza-wa Jall bande ki madad mein hai jab tak woh apne bhai ki madad mein hai"
"2567","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya — woh siqah the — unhon ne kaha: Suhail bin Abu Madani Salih ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khazane ka koi Malik nahin jo apne khazane ki zakat na de, magar qayamat ke din use-khazane ko laya jayega jahannam ki aag se burdah garama ki jati aur un se us ki peshani-pahlu-peeth daaghii jaegi, yahan tak ke Allah Azza-wa Jall apne bandon ke darmiyan us din faisla kare jis ki matke tumhari ginti se pachaas hazaar saal hai phir woh apna rasta dekhega, jannat ya jahannam ki taraf oonton ka koi Malik nahin jo apne oonton ki zakat na de, magar qayamat ke din use-oonton ko laya jaega, jaisi bhari-poori thin un ke liye chhat patthariilaa maidan bichaayaa jaega aur woh use khuron se raundengii. jab bhi aakhri guzregi, pehli us par ne jaegi, yahan tak ke Allah Azza-wa Jall apne bandon ke darmiyan us din faisla kare jis ki matke tumhari ginti se pachaas hazaar saal hai, aur woh apna rasta dekhega, jannat ya jahannam ki taraf bakriyon ka koi Malik nahin jo apni bakriyon ki zakat na de, magar qayamat ke din use-bakriyon ko laya jaega, jaisi bhari-poori thin un ke liye chhat patthariilaa maidan bichaayaa jaega aur woh use seengon se maarengii, khuron se raundengii. jab bhi aakhri guzregi, pehli us par ne jaegi, yahan tak ke Allah Azza-wa Jall apne bandon ke darmiyan us din faisla kare jis ki matke tumhari ginti se pachaas hazaar saal hai phir woh apna rasta dekhega, jannat ya jahannam ki taraf kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, ghode? Farmaya: Ghodon ki peshaaniyon mein qayamat tak bhalai hui hai ghode teen hain; ek ke liye sawab hain, ek ke liye parda hain, doosre par gunah hain rahe jin ke liye woh sawab hain, aadmi unhen Allah Azza-wa Jall ki raah mein bandhe; un ke peton mein jo chhupa woh us ke liye sawab hai agar unhen ghaas mein charae aur un ki rassi lambi kare, un ke peton mein jo chhupa us sab se us ke liye sawab tha agar ek-do teele dauren, un ke uthae har qadam se us ke liye sawab tha agar unhen nahar par se guzare aur us mein se pilaye, un ke peton mein chipii har boondon se us ke liye sawab tha yahan tak ke un ke liida-peshab mein sawab zikr kiya rahe jin ke liye woh parda hain, aadmi ne unhen pakdamani-izzat-khubsurat ke liye liye, aur un ki peeth-pet, tangi-aasani mein un ka haq na bhool rahe jin par woh gunah hain, aadmi ne unhen akara-takabbur-logon ke dikhaave ke liye liye kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, khaccaron ke bare mein tumhara Kya kehna hai? Farmaya: Mujh par us mein yeh jaamea aayat hi nazil hui: {Jo raaii bhar bhalai karega, use dekhega; jo raaii bhar burayi karega, use dekhega}."
"2568","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khaibar ke din farmaya: Main jhanda us aadmi ko dunga jo Allah-Rasulullah se muhabbat karta hai, aur us par fath hogi Umar ne kaha: Main ne us din se pahle kabhi imarat ki khaahisha na ki; main us ke liye lalacaayaa aur ummeed se dekha ke mujhe milta jab agli din hua to Ali ko bulaya aur unhen diya farmaya: Lado, na muro yahan tak ke Allah Azza-wa Jall tum par fath kare to thoda chale phir kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kis par laruun? Farmaya: Yahan tak ke gawahi den Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasulullah hain jab woh aisa karen to un ka khoon-maal mahfooz hua, siwae us ke haq ke; un ka hisab Allah par hai"
"2569","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bunani Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Rabah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Mu'awiyah ke paas wafd kar aae, hamare sath Abu the Hurairah mein se kuch ek-doosre ke liye khana banate the, Abu Hurairah hamen banane walon mein se the aur zyada banate the, hamen apne dere par bulaye the main ne kaha: Kaash khane ka hukm dun aur banaya jae, unhen apne dere par bulaauun. to Main ne kiya Sham ko Abu Hurairah se mila aur kaha: Abu Aey Hurairah, aaj raat mehmaani mere yahan hai to unhon ne kaha: Tum mujh se pahle le gae, Aey Ansari aae to Main ne unhen bulaya; woh mere paas the ke Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Kya tumhen tumhari hadees mein se hadees na bataun, Aey Ansar ki jama'at? Abdullah Ansari bin Rabah the unhon ne kaha: Fath-Makkah zikr ki aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khalid bin Waleed ko ek taraf — daayen-baayen mein se — bheja, Zubair ko doosri taraf bheja, Abu Ubaidah ko beaslahaa paidal par bheja phir mujhe dekha aur farmaya: Aey Hurairah ke bete abuu. to main ne kaha: Hazir-tayyar, Aey Allah ke farmaya farmaya: Ansar pukaro, mere paas sirf Ansari aao unhon ne kaha: Main ne kiya phir farmaya: Quraish-gundon ko dekho aur unhen kaat dalo unhon ne kaha: Ham nikle; mein se koi hamari taraf kuch na karta tha, mein se koi mein se kisi ko chahta to use pakarataa tha Abu aae Sufyan aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Quraish ki jama'at mari; aaj ke baad Quraish nahin to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Abu Sufyan ke ghar dakhil hua, woh aman mein hai; Jis ne hathyar phenke, woh aman mein hai to logon ne hathyar kare Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dakhil hue aur darj se shuru kiya, use chhua, phir saat chakkar lagae, maqam ke peeche do rak'aten padhin phir aae, sath mein shikar thi, us ka dasta pakde the buton mein se ek but ki aankh godne lage aur farmate the: {Haq aaya-batil mita; batil mitane wala tha}. phir chale yahan tak ke Safa aae, us par chadhe yahan tak ke Bait dikhe. Allah ki tareef-dua karne lage Ansar un ke paas the, kehte the: Rahe aadmi, unhen apni basti ki khaahisha hui, apne qabeela par narmi hui Wahy aai, aur jab haq aata to ham se chipii na rehti thi jab Wahy uthi to farmaya: Aey Ansar ki jama'at, tum ne kaha: Rahe aadmi, unhen apni basti ki khaahisha hui, apne qabeela par narmi hui Hargiz nahin, mera naam Kya hai taba. Hargiz nahin, main Allah ka banda-Rasulullah hun zindagi tumhari zindagi hai, maut tumhari maut hai to woh samne aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah ki qasam, Ham ne sirf Allah-Rasulullah ki ghairat se kaha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah-Rasulullah tumhari sach karte hain, tumhen uzr dete hain"
"2570","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd Muhammad bin Talha ki Aal ke aazad-karda Rahman se, Isa bin Talha bin Ubaidullah se, Abu Hurairah se, marfoo'an, unhon ne kaha: Aag mein woh aankh na dakhil hogi jo Allah Azza-wa Jall ke Khawf se roii, yahan tak ke doodh than mein aur bande ke samne mein jahannam ka dhuwen aur Allah ki raah ki gard jama na hogi, ya Musalman ke qadam mein"
"2571","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin Abu Maimunah se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Rafi' ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, ke Unhon ne {jab aasman phategaa} mein sajdah kiya aur kaha: Main ne apne dost (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko us mein sajdah karte dekha; main mil wahan tak sajdah karta rahunga"
"2572","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin Abu Maimunah se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Rafi' ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Maimunah ya Zainab ka naam Barra tha; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ka naam Maimunah ya Zainab rakha"
"2573","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid aur Abu Salih khazzaaza rusatuma aamiira ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Abu Rafi' se, Abu Hurairah se, ke kala aadmi ya kali aurat masjid se gandagi saaf karti thi aur dafan hui Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khabar na di gayi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko is ki khabar di gayi aur farmaya: Mujhe us ki qabr dikhaao. to qabr ki taraf chale, qabron par aae aur farmaya: Yeh qabren apne walon par andhere se bhari hain; Allah Azza-wa Jall meri namaz se unhen raushan karta hai phir qabr par aae aur us par namaz padhi to Ansar mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere baap — ya bhai — mare aur dafan hue, un par namaz padho unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ansari ke sath chale"
"2574","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aziz bin mukhtaara ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Fairuz ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Rafi' se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Mere dost ne mujhe teen ki wasiyat ki — ya'ni Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne: Mahine mein teen din roza, sone se pahle witr, Chasht ki do rakaaten."
"2575","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Abu Rafi' se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi namaz mein hai jab tak apne musalle mein rahe jis mein Us ne namaz padhi, namaz ka intezar karte hue; farishte kehte hain: Aey Allah, use bakhshish de; Aey Allah, us par raham kar; jab tak hadas na kare"
"2576","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Hasan se, Abu Rafi' se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jab woh us ke chaar hisson ke darmiyan baithe, phir koshish kare, to ghusl wajib hua unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne is hadees mein badhaya: Tarah ya na utar"
"2577","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qatadah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Nazr bin Anas ko suna, Bashir bin Nu Haik se bayan karte hue, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi diwaliya ho aur aadmi us ke paas apna saaman pae, woh us ka zyada haqdar hai"
"2578","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Nazr bin Anas se, Bashir bin Nu Haik se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne ghulam mein se hissa aazad kare, woh aazad hai"
"2579","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se: Nazr ko suna, Bashir bin Nu Haik ko suna, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sone ki anguthi se mana kiya"
"2580","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Nazr bin Anas se, Bashir bin Nu Haik se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Umrah jaiz hai"
"2581","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Nazr bin Anas se, Bashir bin Nu Haik se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ki do biwiyan hon aur woh ek ki taraf jhuke, qayamat ke din aayega jabke us ka ek pahlu gira hoga"
"2582","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Nazr bin Anas se, Bashir se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ayyub par sone ki tiddiyan barasiin aur woh unhen sametne lage to un ki taraf Wahy hui: Aey Ayyub, Kya Main ne tumhen kushaada nahin kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Aey Rabb, Teri rehmat-Fazl se kaun sera hoga"
"2583","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, kumaila bin Ziyad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Kya tumhen jannat ke khazanon mein se khazana na bataun? Laahaulaa-wala-quwwata-Allah-billah; na us se panah hai na nijaat, magar usi ki taraf"
"2584","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qatadah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu muraayaa se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Farishte nauha karne wali aur Gaana ki wali par salat nahin padhte"
"2585","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Zurarah se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jab aurat shauhar ka bistar chhodkar raat guzare to farishte us par subah tak lanat karte hain — ya: Laut tak; Abu Dawud ko shak hua"
"2586","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qatadah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zurarah bin Aufa ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne meri ummat se dil ke khayal muaf kiye, jab tak woh bole ya kare nahin"
"2587","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qatadah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hilal bin Yazid ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne siyahi dane ke bare mein farmaya: Us mein maut ke siwa har beemari ki shifa hai unhon ne kaha: Ya'ni shoniiza; Qatadah kehte hain"
"2588","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail bin Abu Salih se, Safwan se, qaaqaaa se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Bukhl-iman bande ke dil mein jama nahin hote"
"2589","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd Khubaib bin Rahman se, Hafs bin Asim se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Saat Allah ke barabar mein hain, jis din us ke barabar ke siwa saya nahin: Insaf wala hakim, insaf wala imam, ibadat mein palaa jawan, masjid se lipta dil wala aadmi yahan tak ke us ki taraf aae, Allah ki muhabbat par jama-juda hone wale do aadmi, chipaakara Sadqa dene wala aadmi yahan tak ke us ka baen na jane dayan ne Kya chhipaya, girana-husn wali aurat se bulaya gayi aur kahe main Allah se darta hun, tanhai Allah ka zikr karne wala aur us ki aankhen Allah Azza-wa Jall ke Khawf se bahen."
"2590","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umari ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd Khubaib bin Rahman se, Hafs bin Asim se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Asr ke baad koi namaz nahin yahan tak ke suraj ghurub; Fajr ke baad koi namaz nahin yahan tak ke suraj nikle"
"2591","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hasan se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Duniya mein resham sirf woh pehenta hai jo aakhirat mein pahanne ki ummeed na rakhe; resham sirf woh pehenta hai jis ka koi hissa nahin"
"2592","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Muhammad Sulaim Hilal ne ham se bayan kiya, Hasan se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Musa ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Apni haya se kar hi ghusl karte the"
"2593","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Jisr Ja'far ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hasan ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi banda raat ko — ya apne bistar par — jaagakara kahe: Allah, Allah, laailaahaa-illalaaha, Allahu-Akbar, Aey Allah, mujhe bakhshish de, magar use bakhsha jayega agar irada kare, uthe, wuzu kare, namaz padhe aur Allah se dua kare, woh use qabool karega"
"2594","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jisr ne ham se bayan kiya, Hasan se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo raat mein Surah-Yasin padhe, Allah ki raza caahakara, use bakhsha jayega"
"2595","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu ashahaba ne ham se bayan kiya, Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Madinah aaya aur Abu Hurairah se mila to Abu Hurairah ne un se kaha: goya tum Shahr walon mein se nahin ho unhon ne kaha: Ji Han unhon ne kaha: Kya tumhen hadees na sunaauun jo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni, shayad Allah tumhen us se nafa de? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bande se qayamat ke din pehla hisab namaz ka hoga Allah Azza-wa Jall apne farishton se farmata hai: Us ki namaz dekho; Us ne poori ki ya kam ki to woh dekhenge; agar poori hui to poori likhi jayegi agar us mein se kuch kam hui to farmata: Mere bande ke farz ko us ke nafl se poori karo phir amal usi hisab se liye jayenge Abu Dawud ne kaha: Main ne Masjid-haram mein ek azeem ko yeh hadees bayan karte suna unhon ne kaha: Hasan ne kaha, jabke woh Abu Hurairah ki majlis mein the jab Unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Allah ki qasam, yeh Adam ke bete ke liye duniya-jo us mein hai se behtar hai"
"2596","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abbad bin minqarii Maisarah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hasan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu logon Hurairah ko bayan kar rahe the ke jawan aaya yahan tak ke apne do kapdon ke darmiyan un par khada hua aur kaha: Mere tehband ke ghasiitane ke bare mein tumhara Kya kehna hai? Ya mere tehband ke ghasiitane ke bare mein? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne sachche dost Aba-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Tum pahle logon mein aadmi tha jo apne do chadron mein itaraataa tha — ya do kapdon ke darmiyan — ke Allah ne use zameen mein dhansaayaa. meri jaan ki qasam, woh qayamat tak us mein dhansataa jata"
"2597","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Hasan se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paanch namazen aur Jume se Jume tak darmiyan ke gunahon ka kaffara hain, jab tak Kabeera se bachte"
"2598","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hasan se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Mere dost ne mujhe teen ki wasiyat ki, main unhen na chhorun: Jume ke din ghusl, sone se pahle witr, mahine mein teen din rozaa."
"2599","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abbad bin Rashid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hasan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamen Abu Hurairah ne bayan kiya, jabke ham us waqt Madinah mein the, unhon ne kaha: Islam qayamat ke din aayega aur Allah Azza-wa Jall farmata: Tum Islam ho, main salam hun aaj tumhare sath dunga, tumhare sath lunga"
"2600","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Zubair se, Abd bin Rahman bin hazzaaza se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Ma'iz hazzaala bin Malik ke paas aae aur kaha: Doosre ne zina kiya unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jao aur unhen khabar do, is se pahle ke tumhare bare mein Quran nazil ho unhon ne kaha: Woh un ke paas aae aur unhen khabar di yahan tak ke chaar martaba gawahi di to Unhon ne rajm ka hukm diya aur rajm kiya gaya un par se do aadmi guzre aur kaha: Afsos is par; Allah ne us par parda dala, lekin Us ne nafs par parda na dala; use kutte jaisa hankara gaya woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae, aur wahan murdaara tha to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Is murdaara mein se noco. to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, yeh murdaara hai, ham Ise na kha rokenge to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne apne bhai se jo liya woh is se zyada badbudar hai meri jaan ki qasam, Main ne use jannat ki nahar mein tairate dekha aur farmaya: Aey hazzaala, Tum ne us par raham kyun na kiya"
"2601","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Dawud bin Audi Abdullah se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, sab zyada Kya logon ko aag mein dakhil karta hai? Farmaya: Do khokhli; sharmgah-munh kaha gaya: Sab zyada Kya logon ko jannat mein dakhil karta hai? Farmaya: Allah ka taqwa, achcha akhlaq"
"2602","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Ammar bin Abu Ammar se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath koi ghanimat nahin dekhi magar Aap ne mujhe us mein se hissa diya, siwae Khaibar ke; woh khaas Hudaibiyah walon ke liye thi Abu Musa aur Abu Hunain-Hudaibiyah Hurairah ke darmiyan aae the"
"2603","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ammar se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log khanija hain; Jahiliyat mein behtar Islam mein behtar hain, jab samajhen."
"2604","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ammar se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qaum Madinah chorengii, jabke Madinah un ke liye behtar hai, kaash woh jaante"
"2605","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abd bin Malik se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise baghair mange maal mile, woh use qabool kare; woh rizq hai jo Allah Azza-wa Jall ne use di"
"2606","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Humaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi ke beton ke aazad-karda Umair se: Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum se ek sone se pahle tikarii Quran padhne se aaziza hai? Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, sone se pahle tikarii Quran ki taqat kaun rakhta hai? Farmaya: Padhe: {Qulahuvallaahu-ahd} aur {Qul-auuzu-birabbila-falaqa} aur {Qul-auuzu-birabbinnaasa}; goya Us ne tikarii Quran padha"
"2607","[AI-translation] Yunus ne, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Humaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu qarraaza Abdullah se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Munafiq chalis raat aakhri Isha par qayam nahin rehta — ya'ni jama'at mein"
"2608","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ziyad se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna: Aba-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chand dekhne roza rakho, chand dekhne iftar karo; agar badal ho to tees gino."
"2609","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Qurashi Ziyad ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna: Hasan bin Ali ne sadqe ki khajooron mein se khajoor li aur munh mein daali to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmane lage: Chi-chi, kankariyon; Kya tum nahin jante ham Sadqa nahin khaate."
"2610","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ziyad ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna: Main ne Aba-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Ghifar, Allah use bakhshish de; Aslam, Allah use salamti de"
"2611","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ziyad ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar log wadi-ghati chalen aur Ansar ghati-wadi chalen, main Ansar ki ghati caluungaa. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Mere walidah-baap un par qurban, Unhon ne zulm nahin kiya; Unhon ne maal taqseem, panah di, madad ki"
"2612","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ziyad se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ko suna, kehte hue: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare Rabb Tabaraka-Ta'ala ne farmaya: Har amal kaffara hai siwae roze ke; woh mera hai, us ka badla main dunga rozedar ke munh ki bu Allah Azza-wa Jall ke han mushk ki khushbu se pakeezah hai"
"2613","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ziyad se: Abu Hurairah ko suna woh vuzuukhaane se wuzu karti qaum par aae aur kaha: Wuzu poora karo; Main ne Aba-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Aediyon ke liye aag se afasosa."
"2614","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ziyad se: Abu Hurairah ko suna: Aba-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Allah Azza-wa Jall use na dekhega jo takabbur se tehband ghasiite."
"2615","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ziyad se: Abu Hurairah ko suna: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Bachcha bistar ka hai, zani ke liye pathar hai"
"2616","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ziyad ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ko suna: Aba-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Donon jootiyan pahno ya donon utaro; jab joote pahno to daayen se shuru karo, jab utaro to baayen se shuru karo"
"2617","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ziyad se: Abu Hurairah ko suna: Aba-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Kya woh nahin darta jo imam se pahle sar uthae ke Allah us ka sar gadhe ka sar bana"
"2618","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi' bin Muslim ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ziyad se: Abu Hurairah ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo logon ka shukr na kare, woh Allah ka shukr nahin karta"
"2619","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ziyad se: Abu Hurairah ko suna: Aba-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jis ne doodh halal bakri khareedi, use ikhtiyar hai; agar kare to us ke sath sa' khajoor kare"
"2620","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu hannaata Bakr ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salih bin Abu Salih ne mujhe bayan kiya: Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aazaadon ka zikr hua, to farmaya: Main un par tum zyada bharosa karta hun, ya tum se kuch se"
"2621","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Yahya Sulaim Balj se, Amr bin Maimun se: Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Kya tumhen Arsh ke neeche jannat ke khazane mein se kalima na bataun? Laahaulaa-wala-quwwata-Allah-hai"
"2622","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Balj se, Amr bin Maimun se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jise iman ka mazaa badla achcha lage, woh bande se sirf Allah ke liye muhabbat kare"
"2623","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd Sa'id bin Abu hurraa ke bhai Rahman ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Sireen ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pukara aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya aadmi ek kapde mein namaz padhe? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum sab do kapde pate ho?."
"2624","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Ibrahim ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Sireen se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jume mein ghadi hai jis mein Musalman aadmi namaz mein mile — ya kaha: Namaz padhte hue, Allah Azza-wa Jall se us mein kuch — ya kaha: Bhalai mange, magar woh use dega aur hath se aise ishara kiya; Abu Dawud apne hath se aage-peeche laye ham ne kaha: Use thodi karte hain ham ne kaha: Use kam karte hain"
"2625","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, bin Sireen se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jume mein ghadi hai jis mein banda khade namaz padhte hue mile, us mein Allah se bhalai mange, magar woh use dega"
"2626","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qurrah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Sireen ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr aur Umar ne {jab aasman phategaa} aur {padho apne Rabb ke naam se Jis ne paida kiya} mein sajdah kiya, aur un se behtar ne"
"2627","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Muhammad bin Sireen se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Namaz mein kamar par hath rakhne se mana kiya gaya"
"2628","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa bin mutaira ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat na hogi yahan tak ke meri ummat mein se log buton ki taraf jaen, Allah ke siwa un ki puujaa karte hue"
"2629","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa bin mutaira ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Hasan-Husain ke bare mein farmate suna: Jo mujh se muhabbat kare, woh in donon se muhabbat kare"
"2630","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa bin mutaira ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Iman Yaman hai, kufr Mashriq ki taraf se hai"
"2631","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa bin mutaira ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dajjal ke qatl par Isa bin Maryam ke siwa kisi ko qadir na di gayi"
"2632","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa bin mutaira ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar aadmi ke paas Uhud bhar Sona ho aur use Allah ki raah mein, Bewah-miskeenon-yateemon mein kharch kare, taake mere sahaba mein se ek ki din ki ghadi ki fazeelat pae, woh kabhi na paaegaa."
"2633","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd Malik bin Umair se, Amr bin Abd bin Rahman ya Umar se — Abu Dawud ne kaha donon mein se ek — ke Abu Abu Hurairah Ghifari Basrah se mile jabke woh aa rahe the, aur kaha: Kahan se aae? Unhon ne kaha: Toor se aaya, wahan namaz padhi unhon ne kaha: Agar main tumhen pata to tum na jate; Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Safar sirf teen masajid ki taraf hai: Meri yeh masjid, Masjid-haram aur Masjid-aqasaa."
"2634","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Sa'id ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr Hazm Amr ko suna, Abd Umar bin Aziz se bayan karte hue, Abu Abd Haris Abd Rahman Bakr se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jab aadmi diwaliya ho aur aadmi us ke paas apna saaman pae, woh qarzakhvaahon se us ka zyada haqdar hai"
"2635","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, Malik bin zalim se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ki halakat Quraish ke naadaana bachchon ke hathon hai"
"2636","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qasim bin Fazl ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Mahri se, ke Abu Hurairah ne un se kaha: Aey Mahri, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pachhna lagane wale ki kamai, badkar aurat ki kamai, kutte ki qeemat aur narr ki jima se mana kiya"
"2637","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Humaid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mahri Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sab afzal ribaata namaz ka intezar aur zikr ki majlison ki muqadma hai koi banda namaz kar phir apni jagah baithe, farishte us par salat padhte rehte hain yahan tak ke woh hadas kare ya uthe."
"2638","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah bin Salih ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah bin Mas'ud se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Aadmi logon ko qarz deta tha, apne ghulam se kehta tha: Jab tangdast tang ho to us se choot do; shayad Allah ham se choot de jab woh Allah Azza-wa Jall se mila to Us ne use muaf kiya"
"2639","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Badashagunii nahin, behtareen badashagunii nekashagunii hai kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, nekashagunii Kya hai? Farmaya: Achchi baat jo tum se ek sune"
"2640","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se, Zaid bin Juhani Khalid se aur Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum se ek ki laundi zina kare to use kode lagao; phir aae to kode lagao; phir aae to kode lagao; phir chauthi martaba aae to use becho, chahe baal ki chotiyon ke badle"
"2641","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Zaid bin Khalid se aur Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Do jhagarane wale Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham tumhen qasam dete hain ke hamare darmiyan kitaabullaaha se faisla karo to us ka hariifa khada hua jo us se zyada samajhdar tha, aur kaha: Ji Haan, Ya Rasulullah, hamare darmiyan kitaabullaaha se faisla karo, mujhe bolne ki ijazat do to Unhon ne use ijazat di aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mera beta is ke paas mazdoor tha, Us ne us ki biwi se zina kiya mujhe khabar gaya ke mere bete par rajm hai, to Main ne us se sau bakriyon aur khadim se fidya diya jab Main ne Ahle-ilm se poocha to Unhon ne mujhe khabar ke mere bete par sau kode aur saal bhar jilawatan hai, is aadmi ki aurat par rajm hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri jaan ki qasam, tumhare darmiyan kitaabullaaha Azza-wa Jall se faisla karunga rahi sau bakriyan-khadim, woh tumhen ne jati hain; tumhare bete par sau kode aur saal bhar jilawatan hai Aey Unais, jao is aadmi ki aurat ke paas; agar iqrar kare to rajm karo to subah us ke paas gaya, us se poocha, Us ne iqrar kiya, use rajm kiya"
"2642","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Yazid se, Abu Zur'ah se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghodon mein shikaala napasand karte the"
"2643","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Abu Ja'far se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab teesri raat baqi rahe to Tabaraka-Ta'ala farmata hai: Kaun hai jo takleef door karna chahe, main us se door karun? Kaun hai jo mujh se rizq mange, main use dun? Kaun hai jo mujh se mange, main use dun?."
"2644","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya se, Abu Ja'far se: Abu Hurairah ko suna, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Teen dua qabool hain: Mazloom ki dua, musafir ki dua, baap ki bete ke liye dua"
"2645","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya se, Abu Ja'far se: Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Qayamat ke din behtar amal Beshak iman hai, baghair khayaanata jihad hai, maqbool Hajj hai Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Maqbool Hajj us saal ke gunahon ka kaffara hai"
"2646","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sayyar aur Mansoor se, Abu Hazim se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jis ne Hajj kiya aur behuudagii-gunah na kiye, woh wapas jaise walidah ne use paida din ko jana tha"
"2647","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin juhaadaa ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hazim ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne laundiyon ki kamai se mana kiya"
"2648","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi bin Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hazim ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mo'min ek aanta mein khata hai, kafir saat aanton mein khata hai"
"2649","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi se: Abu Hazim ko suna, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Peshabandii se mana kiya gaya — ya mana kiye gae — Shehri ka dehati ki taraf se becanaa."
"2650","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi se: Abu Hazim ko suna, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Mana kiya gaya — ya mana kiye gae — doodh rokne, kaha barhaane, aurat ka apni bahan ka talaq mangna taake us ka bartan ulte, aadmi ka apne bhai ke paigham par paigham hun Abu Dawud ne kaha: Goya apne kehne se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Murad hain: Mana kiya"
"2651","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Abbad bin Abu Ali se, Abu Hazim se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ameeron ke liye afsos, amaanatadaaron ke liye afsos, sardaron ke liye afasosa. qayamat ke din qaum tamanna karegi ke un ki chotiyan suraiyaa se latki hoti, aasman-zameen ke darmiyan jhuulate, Unhon ne koi ohadaa na liya hota"
"2652","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi bin Sabit se, Abu Hazim se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bojh chhore woh mujh par hai; jo maal chhore woh waris ka hai Abu Bishr ne kaha: Main ne Abu Waleed ko kehte suna: Is ne qarz wale par namaz chhorne wali hadeesein mansookh kiya"
"2653","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Masrooq se, Abu Hazim se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sura woh nahin jo logon ko pachaare ya logon par ghalib aae; sura woh hai jo apne nafs par ghalib aaye"
"2654","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Abbad bin Abu Ali se, Abu Hazim se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Kahin ki pehli malamat hai, aakhri pachataavaa hai, qayamat ke din azab hai unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Abu Aey Hurairah, mein se jo Allah se dare? Unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen Wahy bayan karta hun jaisa suna"
"2655","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin dinar se, Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Irak bin Ghifari Malik se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ke ghode-ghulam mein Sadqa nahin"
"2656","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid aur Wuhaib bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, Khusaim bin Irak bin Ghifari Malik se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ke ghode-ghulam mein Sadqa nahin"
"2657","[AI-translation] Yunus ne, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne mujhe likha aur Main ne un par padha: Abu Usman ko suna, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne is hujre wale sachche dost Aba-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Rehmat sirf kisi se chiinii jati hai"
"2658","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se: Abu Usman ko suna, Abu Hurairah se, Shu'bah ne kaha: Main nahin janta Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak marfu' kiya ya kaha: Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Jo din-raat mein barah rak'aten nafl padhe, ghair-farz, us ke liye jannat mein ghar banaya jayega Abu Dawud ne kaha: Yeh bhi us mein se hai jo Mansoor ne unhen likha"
"2659","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Humaid bin Abd bin Rahman ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bande ko laeq nahin ke kahe: Main Yunus bin mattaa se behtar hun"
"2660","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin jaramii Kulaib se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Tumhari taraf nikla jabke mujhe shab-Qadr aur gumrah Masih batayi gayi thin masjid mein do aadmiyon ke darmiyan jhagda hua, to main un ke darmiyan chhudane gaya, aur mujhe bhulaa di gayi tumhen us mein se ishara jayega; rahi shab-Qadr, use aakhri ashrah mein taaq raaton mein talash karo raha gumrah Masih, woh kana hai, chhat marte wala, kushada seena wala, us mein jhukaava hai, Abd bin Uzza ke bete qatana tarah to ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya us ki mushabahat mujhe nuqsan degi? To farmaya: Nahin, tum Musalman ho, woh kafir hai"
"2661","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaim bin Hayyan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Gumaan se bacho; gumaan sab jhooti baat hai jasusi na karo, toha na lagao, hijr na todna, peeth na phero, bughz na rakho; Allah ke bande bhai-bhai bano"
"2662","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umarah bin Zazan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Hakam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ilm yaad kare, phir us se poocha jae aur use chhupae, qayamat ke din aag ki Langoat lagakar laya jayega"
"2663","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Abu Aey Hurairah, ruk-rukakara milo, muhabbat barhegii."
"2664","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Utbah ne ham se bayan kiya, Humaid bin Abu Suwaid se, Ata se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Parhaao, sakhti na karo; muallima sakht se behtar hai"
"2665","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Makkah walon mein se ek shaikh ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ata se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Roza pak rakho; roza khana-peena nahin hai, roza gunahon se hai jab tum se ek roza rakhe aur us se aadmi jahalat kare ya use bura de, to kahe: Main rozedar hun"
"2666","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Zamzam se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz mein do kaalon — ya'ni saanp-bichchu — ke qatl ka hukm diya"
"2667","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Zamzam se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz mein do kaalon — saanp-bichchu — ke qatl ka hukm diya"
"2668","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Habib bin Abu Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Umarah bin Umair ko suna, Abu mutavvisa se bayan karte hue — Habib ne kaha: Main ne Abu mutavvisa ko dekha tha — apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Ramazan mein se ek din baghair beemar ke iftar kare jo Allah ne use di, us ki qaza na hogi, chahe woh saal bhar roza rakhe"
"2669","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abd bin Rahman bin Adam se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Isa utarane ke baad zameen mein chalis saal rahenge, phir marenge; Musalman un par namaz padhenge aur unhen dafan karenge"
"2670","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Musa bin Abu Usman se — Shu'bah ne kaha: Woh Kufa ki sab lambi minar par azan dete the — unhon ne kaha: Abu Yahya ne mujhe bayan kiya jabke main un ke sath tawaf kar raha tha — ya'ni Bait ke gird — unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna — Main ne un ke munh se suna: Mu'azzin ko us ki awaz tak bakhsha jata hai; us ke liye har taza-khushka gawahi deta hai namazi ke liye pachees nekiyan likhi jati hain, us se darmiyan ke gunah muaf hote hain"
"2671","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd Muhammad bin Jabbar ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Qurazi Ka'b ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Raham ki qayamat ke din Arsh ke neeche zuban hogi, kahegii: Aey Rabb, main tode gayi; Aey Rabb, mujh par zulm hua; Aey Rabb, mujh se bura sulook hua to us ka Rabb use jawab dega: Kya tum razi nahin ke main use joduun jo tumhen jubbe, jise kare use toruun?."
"2672","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Humaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Qurazi Ka'b se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum se ek ka angaare par baithna use qabr par baithne se behtar hai Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Ya'ni: Hajat-peshab ke liye baithanaa."
"2673","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu Maimunah se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne shab-Qadr ke bare mein farmaya: Woh Sattaiswin — ya unatiisaviin — raat hai; us raat farishte zameen mein kankaron se zyada hain"
"2674","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah bin Abu Yazid se, Nafi' bin Jubair bin Mut'im se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Hasan-Husain ke bare mein farmate suna: Aey Allah, un se muhabbat kar aur us se muhabbat kar jo un se muhabbat kare"
"2675","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dahhak se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ko suna, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hue, farmaya: Jannat mein darakht hai jis ke barabar mein sawar sau saal chale, use arz na kare; woh hamesha ka darakht hai"
"2676","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, Hammam bin munabbiha se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use Khidr sirf liye kaha gaya ke woh jagah baithe aur woh sabz-bhari hilii."
"2677","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abdullah bin Rabah se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chhe se pahle amal mein jaldi karo: Suraj ka Maghrib se nikalna, Dajjal, dhuwen, zameen ka janwar, tum se ek ka khaas muamla, aam maamalaa."
"2678","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Abdullah bin Shaqeeq se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri behtar ummat woh zamana hai jis mein main bheja gaya, phir baad wale — Allah jane teesre ka zikr kiya ya nahin? — Phir qaum pahunchegi jo motapa pasand karegi, mange baghair gawahi degii."
"2679","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bara bin Yazid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Uqaili Shaqeeq ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Kya tumhen jannat ki khabar na dun? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin, Aey Allah ke farmaya farmaya: Woh kamzor-mazloom hain Kya tumhen dozakhiyon ki khabar na dun? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin, Aey Allah ke farmaya farmaya: Har sakht-mein; woh hain jin ke siron mein dard nahin hota"
"2680","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Zubair bin khirriita se, Abdullah bin Shaqeeq se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne hamen khutba diya aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do namazen jama ki — ya'ni Maghrib-ishaa. mere dil mein us se shak raha yahan tak ke Abu Hurairah se mila aur un se poocha, aur Unhon ne un ki sach ki"
"2681","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Faraj bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Shami Sa'd se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Kalimaat jo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sune, main unhen na chhorun: Aey Allah, mujhe apna zikr zyada karne wala bana, apna shukr bada karne wala bana, Teri nasihat par chalne wala bana, Teri wasiyat ki hifazat karne wala bana"
"2682","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Tamimi Sufyan se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe sakht bhook lagi aur Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Maghrib padhi phir Abu Siddiq Bakr ke samne aaya aur Unhon ne mera hath roka Main ne un se Quran ki aayat poocha jise main un se zyada janta tha main un ke sath chala yahan tak ke ghar pahunchi, ummeed thi mujhe dakhil karenge aur Sham ka khana khilaaenge. jab ghar pahunche to Unhon ne mera hath chhoda aur dakhil hue phir Umar ke samne aaya aur Unhon ne mujh se isi kiya phir Ali bin Abu Talib ke samne aaya aur un se Wahy poocha jo un donon se poocha tha, Quran ki aayat ke bare mein jab ham ghar pahunche to kaha: Dakhil ho, Abu Aey Hurairah, Sham ka khao to main dakhil hua aur kaha: Aey phaatimaa, Abu Hurairah ko khilaao. aur pakhane mein dakhil hue aur us mein der baithe, jaise karte the to Unhon ne mere liye roti mangaaii aur Main ne khayi; phir mere liye sattu mangaaii aur Main ne piya Ali nikle aur kaha: Aey phaatimaa, Kya Tum ne Abu Hurairah ko khilaya? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han yeh Umar ko pahunchee aur kaha: Allah ki qasam, Main ne us mein se jo liya, woh mujhe surkh oonton se pasandeeda hai — ya kaha: Mujhe us se pasandeeda hai jis par suraj rawana"
"2683","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musanna bin Zubai Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, bushaira bin Adawi Ka'b se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab raste mein jhagaro to use saat hath banao"
"2684","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Ubaidullah se, Abu raham ke aazad-karda Ubaid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tumhen jannat ke khazane mein se kalima na bataun? Laahaulaa-wala-quwwata-Allah-hai"
"2685","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Ubaidullah se, unhon ne kaha: Abu raham ke aazad-karda Ubaid ko suna, bayan karte hue ke Abu Hurairah ne Madinah ke majlison mein se raste mein aurat dekhi, us se khushbu ki hawa uthii. to Abu Hurairah ne us se kaha: Masjid ka irada hai? Us ne kaha: Ji Han unhon ne kaha: Kya usi ke liye khushbu lagai? Us ne kaha: Ji Han unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Koi aurat nahin jo masjid ke liye khushbu lagae aur Allah Azza-wa Jall us ki namaz qabool kare, yahan tak ke us se ghusl kare jaise janabat se ghusl karti hai to jao unhon ne kaha: Main ne use peeth pherte dekha"
"2686","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musanna ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu Azdi Ayyub se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum se ek pada kare to chehra bachae"
"2687","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Warqa ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd ala bin Rahman se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Allah Tabaraka-Ta'ala ne farmaya: Main shareekon mein sab ghani hun; jo mujh se shirk kare, us ka thoda-zyada usi ka hai"
"2688","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Sulaim Mughirah ke beton mein se Musa bin Sadqa ne ham se bayan kiya, Lais bin Abu Sulaim se, Ziyad se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Mehmani teen din hai; us se zyada Sadqa hai mehmaan chale, gharwalon par takleef na de"
"2689","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Warqa ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd ala bin Rahman se, Abu Sa'ib se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Har namaz jis mein Fatiha na padhi jae, woh naaqisa hai, naaqisa hai"
"2690","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Amr bin Ata se, Abd Muhammad bin Rahman bin Sauban se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha, hath phailaakara uthate hue — ya'ni namaz mein"
"2691","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Aws bin Khalid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ki misaal jo hikmat sune aur sirf buri baat bayan kare, us ki misaal jaisa jise kaha jae: Baade mein dakhil ho aur us mein se mota bakri lo; to woh kutta haankataa rawana"
"2692","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Aws bin Khalid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zameen ka janwar niklega, sath mein Musa ki lathi aur Sulaiman ki anguthi hogi kafir ki naak lathi se daaghegaa, mo'min ka chehra anguthi se camakaaegaa, yahan tak ke log dastarkhwan par jama honge; mo'min kafir se pahchana jayega"
"2693","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Aws bin Khalid se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jume ke din farishte masjid ke darwazon par hain, logon ko un ke darjon par likhte hain falan itne baje aaya, falan aaya jabke imam khutba de raha tha, falan aaya aur namaz pa lekin Juma na paya"
"2694","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Aws se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log qayamat ke din teen qism par uthae jaenge: Sawar, paidal aur munh ke bala. to ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya woh munh par calenge? Farmaya: Jis ne unhen pairon par calaayaa, woh unhen munh par chalane par qadir hai"
"2695","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Uqaili Amir se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Pahle teen jannatiyon aur pahle teen Tauba mujhe dikhaye gaye rahe pahle teen jannatiyon: Shaheed, Allah ka haq ada karne wala aur apne sardar ka kisi ghulam, daman ghareeb baal-bachchon chhae rahe pahle teen Tauba: Musallat Badshah, maal ki daulat wala Jis ne apne maal ka haq na diya, ghareeb shekhiibaaza."
"2696","[AI-translation] Yunus ne, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub bin Utbah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu gubarii Kaseer se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do saudaagara juda hone tak ikhtiyar rakhte hain, ya un ka Saudah ikhtiyar wala ho"
"2697","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub bin Utbah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu suhaimii Kaseer se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sharab do darakhton se hai, khajoor-angoor se"
"2698","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, bin Tawus se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har Musalman par haq hai ke saat dinon mein ghusl kare jaise janabat ka ghusl karta hai; mukammal-sar dhoya, use Jume ke din bana"
"2699","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, bin Abd bin burasuna ke aazad-karda Rahman se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne ham se pahle walon par Juma likha, lekin Unhon ne us mein Ikhtilaf kiya; Allah ne hamen us ki hidayat di Yahood ka Hafta hai, Nasara ka Itwar hai"
"2700","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Muhammad bin Ali se, ke ek aadmi ne Abu Hurairah se kaha: Ali bin Abu Talib ne Jume mein (Juma) aur {jab tumhare paas munafiq aayenge} padhin Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aisa karte the"
"2701","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair bin Muhammad ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa bin Wardan ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi apne dost ke deen par hai; tum se ek dekhe kis se dost karta hai"
"2702","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, sabakhii Farqad se, Yazid bin Abdullah bin shikhkhiira se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Sab jhoote log rangareza-sunar hain"
"2703","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abd bin Rahman bin Adam se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nabi sharik bhai hain; maayein juda hain, deen ek hai main Isa bin Maryam ka sab zyada haqdar hun; mere-un ke darmiyan koi Nabi na tha jab unhen dekho to pahacaano; woh darmiyana qad wale hain, surkhi-safedi ki taraf, do halke range kapdon ke darmiyan, goya sar tapakataa ho, halanke giilaapana na laga ho woh saleeb torenge, suar qatl karenge, maal bahegaa, yahan tak ke Allah un ke zamane mein Islam ke siwa sab deen halaak karega, yahan tak ke Allah un ke zamane mein gumrah Masih kaane jhoote ko halaak karega zameen mein aman hoga, yahan tak ke sheir oonton ke sath caregaa, ciitaa gae ke sath, bheriye bakriyon ke sath; bachche saanpon se khelenge, ek-doosre ko nuqsan na dete phir zameen mein chalis saal rahenge, phir marenge; Musalman un par namaz padhenge aur unhen dafan karenge"
"2704","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Habib bin Abu anamaatii Hasan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin haram ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jabir bin Zaid se namaz-waqton ke bare mein poocha gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ka da'wa hai ke Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Makkah ki taraf safar-hazar mein Makkah mein laut tak do-do rak'aten padhin"
"2705","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Alqamah ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne meri ita'at ki, Us ne Allah ki ita'at ki; Jis ne meri nafarmani ki, Us ne Allah ki nafarmani ki Jis ne ameer ki ita'at ki, Us ne meri ita'at ki; Jis ne ameer ki nafarmani ki, Us ne meri nafarmani ki agar woh baithkar namaz padhe to baithkar padho; jab woh kahe: Allah-li-hamidaa, to kaho: Allahumma-Rab-liye-hamd jab woh {ghairila-maghazuubi-alaihima-valazzaalliina} padhe to amin kaho; jab aasman walon ki baat zameen walon ki baat se mile, bande ke pichhle gunah bakhshe jayenge"
"2706","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ya'la bin Ata ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Alqamah ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) paanch se panah mangte the: Jahannam ke azab, qabr ke azab, jiivana-maut ki aazmaish, Masih-Dajjal ki aazmaish se"
"2707","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Alqamah ko suna — Shu'bah ne kaha: Yunus bin Khabbab ne mujhe bayan kiya: Abu Alqamah ko suna, Abu Hurairah se, lekin Ya'la ne use Abu Hurairah tak marfu' nahin kiya — unhon ne kaha: Jo kahe: Main Allah se saat martaba jannat mangta hun, jannat kehti hai: Aey Allah, use jannat mein dakhil karo jo aag se panah mange, aag kehti hai: Aey Allah, use aag se panah do"
"2708","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Alqamah ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Kisra halaak ho to us ke baad Kisra nahin; jab Qaisar halaak ho to us ke baad Qaisar nahin"
"2709","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Abd Waleed bin Rahman ko suna, Abu Hurairah se bayan karte hue, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jo janaze par namaz padhe, use qeerat hai; jo dafan tak rukakara intezar kare, use do qeerat hain to Ibn Umar ne is ka inkar kiya; Unhon ne A'ishah ki taraf bheja aur un se poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne sach kaha yeh Abu Hurairah ko pahunchi aur unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se na bazaar ka Saudah mashghool karta tha na khajoor ke paudhe lagana; main to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kalima siikhane ya luqma khane ke liye jis rehta tha"
"2710","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Saqafi Asim ko suna, kehte hue: Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna: Abu Siddiq Bakr ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe hukm do jo subah-Sham karun farmaya: Kaho: Aey Allah, ghaib-hazir ke janne wale, aasman-zameen ke paida karne wale, har cheez ke Rabb-Malik, main gawahi deta hun Tere siwa koi ma'bood nahin; Teri panah mangta hun apne nafs ki burayi se, shaitan ki burayi-shirk se subah-Sham-bistar lete waqt kaho"
"2711","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair bin Mu'awiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Taayi Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Abu momineen ki walidah ke aazad-karda madillaa ne mujhe bayan kiya, ke Abu Unhon ne Hurairah ko kehte suna: Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, jab ham Aap paas hote hain to dil Narmi hote hain, ham aakhirat walon mein se hote hain jab ham se juda hote hain aur biwi-bachchon ki bu pate hain to duniya achchi lagti hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum juda kar isi rehte jaise mere paas hote ho, farishte tum hathlion se musaafaa karte, gharon mein tumhari ziyarat karte agar tum gunah na karte to Allah Azza-wa Jall qaum lata jo gunah karte, bakhshish mangte aur woh unhen muaf karta ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamen jannat ki khabar den, us ki imarat Kya hai? Farmaya: Sone ki iinta, chandi ki iinta; gaaraa tez mushk hai; kankariyan moti-yaqoot hain; mitti za'fran hai jo dakhil hoga, khush rahega, kisi na hoga; hamesha rahega, na marega; kapde purana na honge, javaanii fanaa na hogi"
"2712","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Taayi Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Abu madillaa ne mujhe bayan kiya: Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen ki dua nahin lautatii: Insaf wala hakim, rozedar yahan tak ke iftar kare, mazloom ki dua badal par uthai jati hai, us ke liye aasman ke darwaze khole jate hain, Rabb Azza-wa Jall farmata hai: Meri izzat ki qasam, tumhari madad karunga chahe der se"
"2713","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Sa'id bin Abu Hasan se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall ke han dua se izzat wali koi cheez nahin"
"2714","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sadqa bin Musa ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin vaasea ne ham se bayan kiya, sumaira bin nahaara se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare Rabb Azza-wa Jall ne farmaya: Agar mere bande meri ita'at karte to unhen raat mein baarish deta, din mein un par suraj nikalta, unhen karaka na sunaataa."
"2715","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aziz bin Abu Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb bin Kaisan ne ham se bayan kiya, Ubaid bin Laisi Umair se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi banjar mein tha ke badal mein garagaraahata suni, us mein baat suni: Falan ka bagh siinco, naam lekara. to woh badal kali zameen par aaya aur us mein ka pani undelaa. phir naalii ke kinare par aaya, naalii tak pahunchi naalii ne pani samaayaa. aadmi badal ke sath chala yahan tak ke bagh mein khade pani dete aadmi tak pahunchi to kaha: Aey Allah ke bande, tumhara naam Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun poocha? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne badal mein suna — yahi us ka pani hai: Falan ka bagh siinco, tumhare naam se jab tum kato to us mein Kya karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Jab Tum ne yeh kaha, main use teen hisse karta hun: Ek hissa mera-gharwalon ka karta hun, ek hissa us mein wapas karta hun, ek hissa miskeen-saaila-musafir mein karta hun"
"2716","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Ash'as bin Abu riwayat se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, ke woh masjid mein the aur mu'azzin ne azan di, ek aadmi rawana to Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Raha yeh, Us ne Aba-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki nafarmani ki Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen hukm diya tha jab pukarte sunen to masjid se na niklen yahan tak ke namaz padh len"
"2717","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se: Abu Hurairah se sunne wale se, kehte hue: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hatheli-pair bhaari the"
"2718","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, Khusaim bin Irak se, ke Abu Hurairah aur un ki qaum ke log Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas wafd kar aae, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Khaibar nikle paya unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf nikle aur Aap Khaibar fath kiye paya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon se kaha aur Unhon ne hamen apne hisson mein Shareek kiya"
"2719","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Utbah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin zubaidii Waleed se, Zuhri se, anabasaa bin Sa'id se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abu Hurairah se sunne wale ne bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Aas se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Aban bin Sa'id ko Najd ki taraf lashkar mein bheja woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae jabke Aap Khaibar mein the, use fath kar chuke the to Aban ne kaha: Hamen hissa do to main ne kaha: Ham unhen na denge, Aey Allah ke farmaya to Aban ne mujh se kaha: tum ab ho to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Baitho, Aey abaana. aur unhen na diya"
"2720","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub bin Musa se, un ke chacha ke bete se jo unhen zyada bayan karte the, Abu Hurairah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum se ek namaz padhe aur samne sutraa na ho, to lakeer kheenche; samne se guzarne wala use nuqsan na dega"
"2721","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Abu Ziyad se: Abu Hurairah se sunne wale se, kehte hue: Mere dost (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe teen ka hukm diya, teen se mana kiya: Mujhe Chasht ki do rak'aton, mahine mein teen din roze, sone se pahle witr ka hukm diya mujhe teen se mana kiya: Namaz mein lomdi jaisa mudne, bandar jaisa baithne, murghe jaisi thong se"
"2722","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Juhaira bin Yazid ne ham se bayan kiya, Abbas bin hulaisa se: Kufa walon mein se ek aadmi se, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Hurairah ke halqay mein tha aur unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo bande par gawahi de jis woh laeq nahin, woh jahannam mein apna guzarne bana"
"2723","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd Malik bin Umair se, unhon ne kaha: Haris ke beton mein se ek azeem ko suna, bayan karte hue ke Abu Unhon ne Hurairah ko kehte suna: Main ne logon ko Jume ke din roze se mana nahin kiya; Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jume ke din roza na rakho siwae is ke ke us se ek din pahle ya ek din peeche roza rakho Main ne joote mein namaz nahin padhi, lekin Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko joote mein namaz padhte dekha"
"2724","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se: Abu Hurairah se sunne wale se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qurbani ka oont hankate aadmi par aae aur farmaya: Us par sawar ho unhon ne kaha: Woh qurbani ka oont hai farmaya: Us par sawar ho unhon ne kaha: Woh qurbani ka oont hai farmaya: Afsos tum par — ya: Afsos tum par, us par sawar ho"
"2725","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Umair bin Usaid bin Jariyah se, Zuhrah ke beton ke haleef — Abu Hurairah ke sahaba mein se the — Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne das aadmi jaasuusa bheje, un par Asim bin Sabit bin Abu aqalaha ko ameer banaya — woh Asim bin Umar ke dada hain woh chale yahan tak ke hadaa mein the, Usfan-Makkah ke darmiyan, Hudhail ke qabeela Bani lihayaana ko un ki khabar di gayi woh un par sau tiirandaaza lekar ho aae aur un ke nishan par chale yahan tak ke un ki khajoor khayi pa, aur kaha: Yeh yasriba ki khajoor hai jab Asim-sahaba ne unhen mehsoos kiya to teele ki panah li to unhon ne kaha: Utren, tumhen ahd-paimaana hai ke tum se qatl na karenge to Asim ne kaha: Raha main, aaj kafir ki Zimmiyon mein na utaruungaa. Aey Allah, hamari taraf se Nabi ko salam pahuncaao. to un se lade; mein se saat qatl hue, teen ahd-paimaana mein utre jab un par kaabuu paya to kamaanon ki taanten kholin aur unhen bandha jab teen mein se ek ne un se yeh dekha to kaha: Allah ki qasam, yeh pehli ghaddaarii hai us se kushti ki aur use qatl kiya Khubaib bin Adi aur Zaid bin dasinaa ko lekar chale, donon ko Makkah le gae aur becha — yeh Badr ke baad tha Haris ke beton ne Khubaib ko khareeda, Us ne Badr ke din Haris qatl kiya tha Haris ki beti ne kaha: Khubaib hamare paas qaidi tha; Allah ki qasam, Main ne koi qaidi nahin dekha jo Khubaib se behtar ho Allah ki qasam, Main ne use angoor ka gucchaa khate dekha jabke us din Makkah mein koi phal na tha; woh sirf rizq tha jo Allah Azza-wa Jall ne Khubaib ko diya tha us ne kaha: Us ne mujh se mundne ke liye ustaraa qarz manga us ne kaha: Main ne use qarz diya, mera beta rengaa jabke main ghafil thi, aur Main ne use us ki than par bithaya dekha us ne kaha: Main ghabaraaii, aisi ghabrahat jo Khubaib ne pahacaanii. us ne kaha: Woh mujhe samjhe aur kaha: Kya tum samajhti ho main use qatil karunga, main aisa na karunga us ne kaha: Jab woh us ke qatl par jama hue to Us ne un se kaha: mujhe do rak'aten padhne ki ijazat do us ne kaha: Us ne do rak'aten padhin aur kaha: Agar tum samajhte ke mujh mein ghabrahat hai to barhaataa. unhon ne kaha: Khubaib pahle the jinhon sabr se qatl hone wale ke liye namaz ki sunnat daali phir kaha: Aey Allah, unhen gin-ke maar, tukde-tukde maar, mein se koi na chhodo phir sheir padha unhon ne kaha: Mushrikon ne Asim bin Sabit ki taraf bheja taake us ka gosht laya jae; Us ne un ke bade sardaron mein se ek qatl kiya tha to Allah Azza-wa Jall ne barra ke chatte jaisa bheja aur use duuton se bachaya; woh us ke gosht mein se kuch na le sakein"
"2726","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwah se, Wahb bin Kaisan se, unhon ne kaha: Marwan ki bahuon mein se ek mari, janaze mein Marwan-Hurairah ke bete Abu un ke sath hazir hue unhon ne kaha: Marwan ne aurton ko samne suna aur un par sakhti ki — ya un par cillaayaa. to Abu Hurairah ne un se kaha: Aey Abdul-Malik ke bete Abu, ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath janaze mein the, Umar ne aurton ko samne dekha aur unhen pakda — ya un par cillaayaa. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Umar, chhodo; aankh aansu wali hai, dil museebat hai, ghum taza hai"
"2727","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd Shaiban bin Tamimi Rahman ne ham se bayan kiya, Isa bin Ali bin Abdullah bin Abbas se, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas se, marfoo'an, unhon ne kaha: Ghodon ki barkat un ke surkh mein hai"
"2728","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Musa Salim jahazama se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Abbas se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Un se kaha gaya: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumhen kisi cheez se khaas kiya jo logon ko aam na ho? To unhon ne kaha: Nahin, siwae teen ke; hamen hukm diya wuzu poora karen, Sadqa na khaen, gadhe-ghodi ki jima na karae"
"2729","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rahman bin Abu Zinad ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Qurashi Abdullah se, apni walida se, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Unhen ghuurakara na dekho — ya'ni korhii."
"2730","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Tawus se, ke ek aadmi ne Ibn Abbas se saaman khareedne wale ke bare mein poocha, Kya woh use qabz se pahle beche? To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Raha jis se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana kiya, woh khana hai Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Meri rae hai har cheez khane jaisa hai"
"2731","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm hua — ya: Tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko hukm hua — ke saat haddiyon par sajdah kare, kapda-baal na samete."
"2732","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd bin Malik bin Maisarah se, Tawus se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mein sab jaanakaara ne bayan kiya — bin ya'ni Abbas ne — ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum se ek ka apne bhai ko zameen qarz dena behtar hai"
"2733","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Humaid se, bin Tawus se, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aadmi ko dekha Jis ne safed baal badle the, aur farmaya: Yeh achcha hai phir aadmi ko dekha Jis ne dadhi surkh ki thi, aur farmaya: Yeh pahle se behtar hai phir aadmi ko dekha Jis ne dadhi piilii ki thi, aur farmaya: Yeh un sab behtar hai"
"2734","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Madinah walon ke liye zulahulaifaa, Sham walon ke liye Juhfah, Najd walon ke liye Qarn, Yaman walon ke liye Yalamlam muqarrar kiya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh mawaaqeet apne walon ke liye hain, aur har us ke liye jo ghair mein se un par aae, Jis ne Hajj-umrah ka irada kiya jo us se neeche ho, jahan se chale; isi hi yahan tak ke Makkah wale Makkah se ehram baandhen."
"2735","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Lais se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aasani karo, sakhti na karo; jab tum se ek ko gussa aae to khamosh rahe"
"2736","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, bin Tawus se, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Farz walon ko pahuncaao; jo bache woh qareeb mard ka hai"
"2737","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se: Jabir bin Zaid ko suna: Ibn Abbas ko suna: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Arafat mein khutba dete suna, farmaya: Jise jootiyan na milte woh mouze pahne; jise tehband na mile woh shalwar pahne"
"2738","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Jabir bin Zaid se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ehram mein nikah kiya Amr ne kaha: Jabir ne mujh se kaha: hamara khayal hai woh Maimunah hain"
"2739","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Habib bin anamaatii Yazid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin haram ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jabir bin Zaid se namaz-waqton ke bare mein poocha gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas kehte the: Fajr ki namaz ka waqt tulu' se suraj ki kirana nikalne tak hai jo us se ghafil ho, woh na padhe yahan tak ke chadhe aur us ke seeng jaen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat chale phir aakhri raat thehre; na jage yahan tak ke suraj nikla ya us ka kuch hissa; Aap ne na padhi yahan tak ke buland hua"
"2740","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr se, Jabir se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Madinah mein saat-aath sath padhin"
"2741","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Habib ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin haram se, Jabir se, ke Ibn Abbas ne mashaghuuliyata se Zuhr-Asr jama ki, aur Ibn Abbas ka da'wa hai ke Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Madinah mein Zuhr-Asr sath padhin"
"2742","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne lakdi-roghan-naqeer — ya tumba, Abu Dawud ko shak hua — se mana kiya"
"2743","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi bin Sabit se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jandar ko nishana na banao main ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se? Unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se"
"2744","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jabir ne mujhe khabar di, Ammar se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke liye masjid banae, chahe titar ke ande ke ghonsle jaisi, Allah Azza-wa Jall us ke liye jannat mein ghar banata"
"2745","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi bin Sabit aur Ata bin Sa'ib se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jibreel ne mujh se kaha: kaash tum mujhe dekhte jabke main samandar ki keechad lekar Fir'aun ke munh mein thoons raha tha, dar se ke use rehmat pahunche"
"2746","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se saanp marne ke bare mein poocha, to farmaya: Insan-saanp barabar paida kiye gae; agar use dekhe to woh use daraaegaa, agar use kaate to use dard dega unhen jahan pao maro"
"2747","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far bin Iyas ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin Jubair ko suna, Ibn Abbas se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Main aaya jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padh rahe the; main un ke baayen khada hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe daayen kiya"
"2748","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin Jubair ko suna, Ibn Abbas se bayan karte hue, ke aurat ne Hajj ki nazr mani aur marii. us ke bhai ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha, to farmaya: Batao, agar us par qarz hota, Kya tum use ada karte? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han farmaya: Allah ka haq ada karo; woh wafa ka zyada haqdar hai"
"2749","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin Jubair ko suna, Ibn Abbas se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Meri khala hufaida ki walidah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ghee-paneer-goh tohfe mein din Aap ne ghee-paneer mein se khaya, goh napasand karke chorii. woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke dastarkhwan par khayi gayin; agar haram hoti to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke dastarkhwan par na khayi jati"
"2750","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hushaim ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, ke aadmi ko sawari ne giraayaa aur woh mara jabke woh ehram mein tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use pani-beri se ghusl do, do kapdon mein kafan do, sar chhat rakho; use khushbu na lagao; woh qayamat ke din talbiyaa kehte uthaya jayega"
"2751","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mushrikon ke bachchon ke bare mein poocha gaya, to farmaya: Allah jane woh Kya karte"
"2752","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah aae aur Yahood ko roze se paya to farmaya: Yeh Kya hai? To unhon ne kaha: Yeh woh din hai jis mein Allah Azza-wa Jall ne Fir'aun duboyaa aur Musa ko nijaat di to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main Musa ka zyada haqdar hun to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke roze ka hukm diya"
"2753","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roza rakhte the yahan tak ke kehte the: Iftar ka irada nahin; iftar karte the yahan tak ke kehte the: Roze ka irada nahin Aap ne Madinah aae din se poora Maheena roza nahin rakha siwae Ramazan ke"
"2754","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ma'iz bin Malik se farmaya: Kya woh sach hai jo mujhe tumhare bare mein pahunchi? Unhon ne kaha: Tumhen mere bare mein Kya pahunchi? Farmaya: Mujhe pahunchi Tum ne falan ki laundi se zina kiya unhon ne kaha: Ji Han to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen chaar martaba diya, phir un ke rajm ka hukm diya"
"2755","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Musa bin Abu A'ishah se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, Allah Azza-wa Jall ke kehne ke bare mein: {Apni zuban na hilao us se jaldi ke liye}. unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nazil hone mein mashaqqat uthate the aur honth hilate the — Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Main honth hilata hun jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hilate the Sa'id ne kaha: Main honth hilata hun jaisa Main ne Ibn Abbas ko honth hilate dekha — to Allah Tabaraka-Ta'ala ne nazil kiya: {Apni zuban na hilao us se jaldi ke liye hamen use jama karna-qira'at karna hai}. unhon ne kaha: Use dil mein jama karo phir padho {jab ham use padhe to us ki qira'at ki pairwi karo} kehte hain: Suno-khamosh Hazrat {phir hamen us ka bayan karna hai} unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us ke baad jab Jibreel jate to use padhte jaisa Unhon ne padhaya tha"
"2756","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qurrah bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Zubair ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin Jubair ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zuhr-Asr jama ki, Maghrib-Isha jama kiya main ne kaha: Us se Kya irada kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Irada kiya ke un ki ummat tangi mein na ho"
"2757","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Butaina Muslim ko suna, Sa'id bin Jubair se bayan karte hue, Ibn Abbas se, ke aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur un se zikr kiya ke us ki bahan ne Maheena bhar roze ki nazr mani thi, woh samandar par sawar hui aur mari, roza na rakha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Apni bahan ki taraf se rakho"
"2758","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Butaina Muslim ko suna, Sa'id bin Jubair se bayan karte hue, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zulhijjah ke das dinon mein amal un se behtar nahin unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah ki raah mein jihad bhi nahin? To farmaya: Allah ki raah mein jihad bhi nahin, siwae us aadmi ke jo apni jaan-maal lekar Allah Azza-wa Jall ki raah mein nikla, phir us mein se kuch lekar na aaya"
"2759","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Unhon ne apni khala Maimunah ke ghar raat bitaaii. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aakhri Isha ke baad aae aur chaar rak'aten padhin, phir hue phir uthe aur farmaya: Kya ladka soya? Ya us ke jaisi kalima phir namaz padhne uthe; main un ke baayen khada hua Unhon ne mujhe pakda aur daayen kiya phir paanch rak'aten padhin, phir soe yahan tak ke Main ne kharraataa suna phir nikle aur namaz padhi"
"2760","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Sa'b bin jasaamaa ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko — jabke Aap Qudaid mein the aur ehram mein the — li gadhe ka pichalaa hissa tohfe mein diya, khoon tapakataa hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use diya"
"2761","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jume ke din Fajr ki namaz mein {Alif-Lam-Meem Tanzeel} aur {Hal-Ata} padhte the"
"2762","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Ya'la bin Hakim se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, Unhon ne haram ke bare mein kaha: Qasam hai, us ka kaffara dega aur kaha: {Tumhare liye Rasulullah mein umdah namuna tha}."
"2763","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mukhawwal se, Muslim se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jume mein Surah-Juma aur Surah-Munafiqun padhte the, aur Jume ke din Fajr ki namaz mein {Alif-Lam-Meem Tanzeel} aur {Hal-Ata-alal-insan} padhte the"
"2764","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi bin Sabit se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Eid ke din do rak'aten padhin; un se pahle-peeche koi namaz na padhi phir aurton ke paas aae, sath mein Bilal the unhen sadqe ki taraghiiba di; aurten baaliyaan-haar dalne lageen"
"2765","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Mughirah bin Sauri Sufyan Nu'man ke paas gae, Unhon ne Sufyan ko karaya jabke main sath tha jab woh uthe to Main ne use Sufyan se naql kiya hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin Jubair ko suna, Ibn Abbas se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen mauaizaa dete khade hue aur farmaya: Aey logon, tum Allah Azza-wa Jall ki taraf nange pair-nange jism-ghair uthae jao; {jaisi Ham ne pehli paida shuru ki, isi karen} aayat pehli makhlooq jise qayamat ke din kapda pahnaya jaega, Ibrahim hain Khabardar, meri ummat ke aadmi jane jaenge aur baayen pakde jayenge to main kahunga: Mere saathii. to kaha jaega: Tum nahin jante Unhon ne tumhare baad Kya naya kiya to main kahunga jaisa neaaka bande ne kaha: {Main un par gawah tha jab tak un ke darmiyan raha} aayat aakhir tak to mujh se kaha jaega: Yeh jabase tum juda hue, ulte pair murtadda rahe"
"2766","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki wafat hui jabke main das saal ka tha, khatnaashudaa tha, Quran ka muhakama padh chuka tha Shu'bah ne kaha: Main ne Abu Bishr se kaha: Quran ka muhakama Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Mufassala."
"2767","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki wafat hui jabke main pandrah saal ka tha, khatnaashudaa tha"
"2768","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Mujahid se, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Meri puurbaa hawa se madad hui, aada kauma pachuaa hawa se halaak hui"
"2769","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Mujahid se, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmate the: Yeh umrah hai jis se Ham ne nafa uthaya; jis ke sath qurbani na ho, woh poora halal ho; umrah qayamat tak Hajj mein dakhil hua"
"2770","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Mujahid se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh aayat padhi: {Allah se daro jaisa us se darne ka haq hai; Musalman hi maro}. phir farmaya: Agar zaqquuma ki boondon duniya ke samandaron mein tapake to duniya walon ki rizq baghair; jis ka khana ho us ka Kya haal?."
"2771","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Mujahid se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ramazan mein nikle; jab Usfan pahunche to iftar kiya"
"2772","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd bin Karim se, Mujahid ya Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe sote-baat karte logon ke peeche namaz se mana kiya gaya"
"2773","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Mujahid se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) do qabron par aae aur farmaya: Unhen azab ho raha hai, Kabeera mein nahin raha ek, woh logon ka gosht khata tha; raha doosra, woh Chugalkhor tha phir khajoor ki tehni mangaaii, use kar aadha-aadha kiya aadha is qabr par rakha, aadha is qabr par rakha aur farmaya: Shayad un se halka ho jab tak donon taza rahen"
"2774","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Shaibani Sulaiman se, unhon ne kaha: Sha'bi ko kehte suna: Mujhe Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhne wale ne bayan kiya, woh alag qabr par aae, unhen peeche saf banaya aur us par namaz padhi to Main ne Sha'bi se kaha: Tumhen Kis ne khabar, Abu Aey Amr? Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ibn Abbas ne bataya"
"2775","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, unhon ne kaha: Sha'bi ko suna, Ibn Abbas se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Zamzam aae aur pani manga main pani laya; Aap ne khade kar piya"
"2776","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Hadiya karne wala qai-ulti mein laut jaisa hai"
"2777","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se: Abu Aliya ko suna, kehte hue: Mujhe tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke chacha ke bete — bin ya'ni Abbas — ne bayan kiya, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bande ko laeq nahin ke kahe: Main Yunus bin mattaa se behtar hun; unhen baap ki taraf nisbat di"
"2778","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu Aliya se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) museebat ke waqt kehte the: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, azeem-haliima; Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, Arsh-azeem ka Rabb; Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, aasmanon ka Rabb, zameenon ka Rabb, Arsh-Karim ka Rabb"
"2779","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sar ke darmiyan pachhna lagwaya, us ka naam Munqiz rakha"
"2780","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ata bin Abu Rabah ko suna, Ibn Abbas se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ka'ba mein dakhil hue jabke woh us din chhe sutoonon par tha har sutoon ke paas khade hue, dua ki, namaz na padhi"
"2781","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ham ambiya ki jama'at ko hukm hua jaldi iftar karen, der seharii karen, namaz mein dayan baayen par rakhen"
"2782","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, unhon ne kaha: Ata ko kehte suna: Main Ibn Abbas par gawahi deta hun ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Eid ke din nikle aur namaz padhi, phir khutba diya phir aurton ke paas aae aur unhen sadqe ki taraghiiba di; woh dalne lageen"
"2783","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hajjaj bin artaaa se, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ehram mein Maimunah se nikah kiya"
"2784","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne rozedar kar pachhna lagwaya"
"2785","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, isla bin Tamimi Sufyan se, Ata se, unhon ne kaha: bin Zubair ne hamen namaz padhai aur Maghrib ki do rak'aton mein salam phera phir rukn chhua un se is mein kaha gaya to aae aur ek rak'at padhi, do sajde kiye Ibn Abbas se bin Zubair ke kaam ka zikr kiya gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat se na gaya"
"2786","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ibn Abbas se aur Talha ne, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe nangaapana se mana kiya gaya, yeh nabuwwat utarane se pahle tha"
"2787","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kharijah bin masaaba ne ham se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Aslam se, Ata bin Yasar se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Kya tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka wuzu dikhaun? To ham ne kaha: Kyun nahin to ek-ek martaba wuzu kiya; ek martaba kulli ki, ek martaba naak mein pani dala, ek martaba chehra dhoya, donon hath kuhniyon tak ek-ek martaba dhoya, sar ka masah kiya, donon pair joote par ek-ek martaba dhoya"
"2788","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin Qurashi Khalid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ata bin Yasar se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tumhen behtar darje walon ki khabar na dun? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin, Aey Allah ke farmaya farmaya: Ghati mein alag aadmi, namaz qayam karta hai, zakat deta hai, logon ki burayi se alag rehta hai phir farmaya: Kya tumhen badtareen darje walon ki khabar na dun? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin, Aey Allah ke farmaya farmaya: Aadmi jis se Allah ke naam par manga jae aur woh na de"
"2789","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kharijah bin masaaba ne ham se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Aslam se, Ata bin Yasar se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko haddi-gosht khate dekha, phir namaz ke liye khade hue; wuzu-kulli na kiya"
"2790","[AI-translation] Yunus ne, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maajishuuna aur Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Aurat Hajjat-wa'da ke saal Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur kaha: Bandon par Hajj farz mere boodhe-kamzor baap ko pahunchi; woh sawari par na jama sakta hai Kya us ki taraf se Hajj karna kafi hoga? Farmaya: Ji Han"
"2791","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qurrah bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Sireen se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Makkah-Madinah ke darmiyan safar kiya, Allah Azza-wa Jall ke siwa kisi se na darte hue, do-do rak'aten padhte hue"
"2792","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abbad bin Mansoor ne ham se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Sham ko Abu tayabaa ki taraf bheja; Us ne pachhna lagaya aur use kharch di"
"2793","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abbad ne ham se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare behtar pachhna satrah, unnis, ikkiisa mein hai"
"2794","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abbad bin Mansoor ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ikrimah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: {Jo paakadaamanon par tohmat lagayen aur chaar gawah na laen} aayat ke aakhir tak, to Sa'd bin Ubadah ne kaha: Kya aise nazil hui? Agar main badkar aurat ko paun jis par aadmi chadha ho, mujhe haq na hoga ke use hilaauun ya wajah dilaauun yahan tak ke chaar gawah laaun? Allah ki qasam, main chaar gawah na laauungaa yahan tak ke woh hajat poori kare to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Ansar ki jama'at, Kya tum nahin sunte tumhare sardar Kya kehte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, unhen malamat na karo; woh ghairatamanda aadmi hain Allah ki qasam, Unhon ne mein kabhi kunwari ke siwa ihsan nahin ki, na apni kisi biwi ko talaq di ke mein se kisi aadmi ne us se ihsan ki taqat ki, un ki sakht ghairat se to Sa'd ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main janta hun Ya Rasulullah, woh haq hai, Allah Azza-wa Jall ki taraf se hai, lekin mujhe ta'ajjub hua Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) isi hi the ke Hilal aae bin vaaqifii Umayyah — woh teen mein se hain jin ki Allah ne Tauba qabool ki — aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main kal raat Sham ko apne bagh se aaya jis mein main tha, aur apne gharwalon ke paas aadmi dekha; Main ne aankhon se dekha, kaanon se suna to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use napasand kiya jo woh laya to kaha gaya: Kya Hilal ko kode lagenge aur Musalmanon mein us ki gawahi batil hogi? To Hilal ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah ki qasam, main Aap chehre mein dekhta hun ke Aap use napasand karte hain jo main laya, lekin mujhe ummeed hai Allah rasta banata unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) isi hi the ke Aap par Wahy nazil hui Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par jab Wahy nazil hoti to mukammal-chehra badal jata, sathi ruk jate aur mein se koi Aap se baat na karta tha jab Wahy uthi to farmaya: Khushkhabri ho, Aey hilaala. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use bulao to woh bulaya gayi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Tabaraka-Ta'ala janta hai tum se ek jhoota hai; Kya tum se koi Tauba karne wala hai? To Hilal ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Ya Rasulullah, Main ne sach hi kaha, Main ne sach ki unhon ne kaha: Us ne us waqt kaha: Us ne jhoot farmaya unhon ne kaha: Hilal se kaha gaya: Kya tum chaar gawahiyan doge ke tum saccon mein se ho? Panchwin par un se kaha gaya: Aey Hilal, Allah se daro; Allah ka azab logon ke azab se sakht hai; yeh wajib karne wali hai jo tum par azab wajib karegi unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Allah mujhe us par kabhi azab na dega, jaise Us ne mujh par kode nahin lagae to panchwin gawahi di ke us par Allah ki lanat ho agar woh jhuuthon mein se ho us se kaha gaya: Chaar gawahiyan do ke woh jhuuthon mein se hai panchwin par us se kaha gaya: Aey aurat, Allah se daro; Allah ka azab logon ke azab se sakht hai; yeh wajib karne wali hai jo tum par azab wajib karegi woh thodi der ruk, phir kaha: Allah ki qasam, main apni qaum ko zaleel na karungi to panchwin gawahi di ke us par Allah ka gussa ho agar woh saccon mein se ho unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla kiya ke na use tohmat lage na us ke bachche ko; jo use ya us ke bachche ko tohmat lagae, use hadd ke kode lagenge. use us se kharch-rehaish nahin hai; kyunke woh baghair talaq juda hote hain, na us se Bewa hui jis ki maut hui Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use dekho; agar woh ghane balon wala, gore, tedhi pindli, patli pindli wala jane to woh Hilal bin Umayyah ka hai agar woh mota pindli, phaad cuutara, gandumii, ghungrale, oont jaisa jane to woh us ke sathi ka hai unhon ne kaha: Woh gandumii, ghungrale, oont jaisa, mota pindli, phaad cuutara wala jana to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar qasmen na hoti to mera-us ka muamla hota Abbad ne kaha: Main ne Ikrimah ko kehte suna: Main ne use shaharon mein se Misr ka ameer dekha, us ka baap ma'loom nahin tha"
"2795","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ramazan mein khwab mein dikhaayaa gaya jabke main soya tha, aur mujh se kaha gaya: Aaj raat shab-Qadr hai to main raha; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padh rahe the Main ne khaime ki rassi pakdi; woh caubiisaviin raat thi Main ne subah suraj ko dekha; us ki kirana na thi"
"2796","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek aur Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya har saal Hajj hai? Farmaya: Nahin, lekin ek Hajj; agar main kehta har saal, to har saal hota"
"2797","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur chhat bayan kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bayan mein jadu hai; sheir mein daanaaii hai"
"2798","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chand dekhne Ramazan roza rakho, chand dekhne iftar karo agar tumhare-us ke darmiyan badal-dhundha ho to shaabaana ka Maheena tees poora karo; shaabaana ke din ke roze se Ramazan ka aamdeed na karo"
"2799","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) chhoti chataai par namaz padhte the"
"2800","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Allah Azza-wa Jall ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Ka'ba ki taraf phera — us ki taraf namaz padhne ke liye — to unhon ne kaha: Hamare sahaba ka Kya hoga jo mare jabke woh baitul-Maqdis ki taraf namaz padhte the? To Allah Azza-wa Jall ne nazil kiya: {Allah tumhara iman zaya na karega}."
"2801","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Dabbi Mu'az ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Abdullah bin Haris ki phufii Musalman hui, hijrat ki, ihsan ki; us ka shauhar us se pahle Musalman ho chuka tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use us ke shauhar ki taraf diya"
"2802","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aadmi se bai'at ki; jab us se bai'at ki to farmaya: Ikhtiyar karo phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Saudah isi hai"
"2803","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sahaba ke darmiyan bhai kiya, ek-doosre se wirasat dilaaii, yahan tak ke nazil hui: {Rishtedar ek-doosre ke zyada haqdar hain}. to Unhon ne woh chhoda aur nasab se wirasat paya"
"2804","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) safar mein roza rakhte the, iftar karte the"
"2805","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, unhon ne kaha: Ikrimah ko suna, Ibn Abbas se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Dajjal ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Gore, khaanadaanii, kana; logon mein sab zyada musabihat qatana ke bete Abdul-Uzza se — ya kaha: Qatara se agar halaak hone wala halaak ho to tumhara Rabb kana nahin hai"
"2806","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aurat-mard ki mushabahat karne walon par lanat ki"
"2807","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salamah bin vaharaama se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne shab-Qadr ke bare mein farmaya: Narmi-raushan raat; na garmi-na sarda; us ki subah suraj kamzor-surkh nikalegaa."
"2808","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abbad ne ham se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Surma lagao; woh nazar saaf karta hai, baal ugaataa hai da'wa kiya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki suramaadaanii thi jis se har raat surma lagate the, teen-teen martaba is-us aankh mein"
"2809","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jahiliyat mein mare baap-daadaaon par fakhr na karo; meri jaan ki qasam, gubarailaa jo naak se lurhakaae, tumhare Jahiliyat mein mare baapon se behtar hai"
"2810","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mu'az ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Saudah dariin ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhen talaq denge, to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe talaq na do, mujhe rakho, mera din A'ishah ko do to Aap ne kiya yeh aayat nazil hui: {Agar aurat shauhar se nafrat-ruugardaanii se dare} aayat unhon ne kaha: Jis par woh sulah karen, woh jaiz hai"
"2811","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rahman bin Abu Zinad ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Abu Muttalib ke aazad-karda Amr se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki tilawat ghar se sunta tha jabke main hujre mein tha"
"2812","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Doodh na roko, ek-doosre par kaha na carhaao."
"2813","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jab fath-Makkah hua to paneer dekha aur farmaya: Yeh Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Yeh ajama ka khana hai unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us mein chhuri maro, bismillaaha padho aur khao"
"2814","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Habib bin Yazid ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin haram se, Sa'id bin Jubair aur Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zubair ki beti Zubair ko Hajj mein shart lagane ka hukm diya Us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hukm se woh kiya"
"2815","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mukatab ki diyat khayal jitna us mein se aazad hua, aazad ki diyat se; jitna us mein se ghulam raha, ghulam ki diyat se unhon ne kaha: Ali-Marwan Wahy kehte the"
"2816","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mashriq ki taraf se qaum niklegi jo Quran parhegii, un ke halaq se na utaregaa. woh deen se hain — ya kaha: Islam se hain, jaise teer shikar se nikle"
"2817","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Haris Qudamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Warraq Matar ya ek aadmi se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Madinah hijrat ke baad Mufassal mein se kisi mein sajdah nahin kiya"
"2818","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Agar woh mere paas jane jate to main unhen marte; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke kehne se: Jo deen badle, use qatl karo"
"2819","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ne ham se bayan kiya, Lais bin Abu Sulaim se, Abd bin Malik se — Abu Dawud ne kaha: Mera khayal hai bin Abu Bashir hain — Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nekashagunii lete the, badashagunii na lete the; achcha naam pasand karte the"
"2820","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Yusuf bin maharaana se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas aae jabke Usamah peeche sawar the Ham ne unhen is nabeez se pilaya — ya'ni mashkize ki nabeez se"
"2821","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Yusuf bin maharaana se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Allah Azza-wa Jall ke kehne ke bare mein farmaya: {Jab qarz lo miyaada tak to use likho} aayat ke aakhir tak: Pahle inkar karne wala Adam tha Allah ne use aulaad dikhai; Us ne chamakti aadmi dekha, us ka Noor raushan tha kaha: Aey Rabb, yeh kaun hai? Farmaya: Yeh tumhara beta Dawud hai kaha: Aey Rabb, us ki umar Kya hai? Farmaya: Saath saal kaha: Aey Rabb, us ki umar karo farmaya: Nahin, siwae is ke ke apni umar se karo kaha: Meri umar Kya hai? Farmaya: Hazaar saal Adam ne kaha: Main ne use chalis saal hadiya diya unhon ne kaha: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne us par Kitab likhi, farishton ko us par gawah banaya jab maut aai aur farishte aae to kaha: Meri umar se chalis saal baqi hain unhon ne kaha: Tum ne apne bete Dawud ko diye the kaha: Main ne kisi ko kuch nahin diya unhon ne kaha: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne Kitab nikali, farishton ne us par gawahi di"
"2822","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Yusuf bin maharaana se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jibreel ne mujh se kaha: Aey Muhammad, kaash tum mujhe dekhte jabke main samandar ki keechad lekar Fir'aun ke munh mein thoons raha tha, dar se ke use rehmat pahunche"
"2823","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Yusuf bin maharaana se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Usman bin Maz'un ki wafat hui to un ki biwi ne kaha: Mubarak ho tumhen, Aey Maz'un ke bete, Jannat unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ki taraf gusse ki nazar se dekha us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aapka dasta-saathii. farmaya: Main nahin janta us ke sath Kya hoga yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba par giraan hua; woh un ke behataron mein kare jate the yahan tak ke Rasulullah ki beti ruqayyaa ki wafat hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hamare pahle Usman bin neaaka Maz'un se mil jao unhon ne kaha: Aurten ruqayyaa par royeen; Umar unhen mana-marne lage to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Thehro, Aey Umar unhon ne kaha: Phir farmaya: Shaitan ki ciikha se bacho; jo aankh-dil se ho woh rehmat se hai, jo zuban-hath se ho woh shaitan se hai unhon ne kaha: Phaatimaa qabr ke kinare ruqayyaa par rone Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke chehre se aansu hath — ya kaha: Kapde — se ponchhne lage"
"2824","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se: Abu Araz Hassan ko suna, Sulaim bin Hujaimi Abd se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Kya khabren hain jo logon mein phaili hain? Kehte hain: Jo Bait ka tawaf kare, woh halal hua? Unhon ne kaha: Woh tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat hai, chahe tumhen napasand ho"
"2825","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu Araz Hassan se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab zulahulaifaa aae to apni qurbani ko kohan ke daayen taraf se nishan kiya Shu'bah ne kaha: Phir us se khoon ponchaa. Hisham ne kaha: Phir us se khoon hataya, Hajj ka ehram bandha Hisham ne kaha: Zuhr ke waqt ehram bandha aur use do jootiyon ka haar pahanaayaa. Shu'bah ne kaha: Main ne yeh hadees Sauri Sufyan ko bayan ki, to unhon ne kaha: Duniya mein Qatadah jaisa kaun tha — ya'ni hadees mein"
"2826","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ghanawi Asim se, Abu Tufail se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Tumhari qaum da'wa karti hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne oont par Bait ka tawaf kiya, woh sunnat hai unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne sach-jhoot kaha main ne kaha: Sach-jhoot Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Sach kaha; oont par tawaf kiya, sunnat nahin hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko log marte-dhakelate na the, liye oont par tawaf kiya taake baat sunen, un ke hath na pahuncen. main ne kaha: Da'wa karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bait ka ramal kiya, woh sunnat hai unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne sach-jhoot kaha main ne kaha: Sach-jhoot Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Sach kaha; daud, jhoot kaha; sunnat nahin hai Quraish ne kaha: Muhammad-sahaba ko chhodo yahan tak ke naghafa ki maut maren. jab Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sulah ki ke agle saal aayenge aur Makkah mein teen din thaharenge, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)-sathi aae, mushrik quaaiqiaana ki taraf the sahaba se kaha: Karo, sunnat nahin hai main ne kaha: Tumhari qaum da'wa karti hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Safa-Marwah ki sa'i ki, woh sunnat hai unhon ne kaha: Sach kaha Ibrahim ko jab manasik dikhaye gae to masaaa ke paas shaitan aaya, us se daud, Ibrahim aage nikle phir Jibreel unhen lekar chale yahan tak ke Mina jane, farmaya: Logon ka guzarne yeh hai phir jamaraatula-Aqabah pahunche; shaitan aaya aur use saat kankariyan maare yahan tak ke woh darmiyan wali Jamrah ki taraf gaya shaitan aaya aur use saat kankariyan maare yahan tak ke gaya phir aakhri Jamrah aae; shaitan aaya aur use saat kankariyan maare yahan tak ke gaya phir Muzdalifah jane aur farmaya: Yeh mashaara-haram hai phir Arafat jane aur farmaya: Yeh Arafat hai Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Tum jante ho Arafat ka naam kyun hua? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin unhon ne kaha: Kyunke Jibreel ne un se kaha: Kya Tum ne pahchana? Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Tum jante ho talbiyaa kaise tha? Unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ko jab Hajj ki azan ka hukm hua to pahadon ko hukm hua aur Unhon ne sar nahin, un ke liye hain uthai gaen Unhon ne logon mein Hajj ki azan di"
"2827","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne rozedar kar pachhna lagwaya"
"2828","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hajjaj se, Hakam se, Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Jaafar-Zaid-raavaahaa ke bete bin ko bheja — ya'ni muutaa ke lashkar mein bin raavaahaa rah gae, qaum calii. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Tum kyun rah gae? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Juma hai, kar jaunga to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein subah-Sham duniya-jo us mein hai se behtar hai"
"2829","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Abu Ziyad se, Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne rozedar-ehram kar pachhna lagwaya"
"2830","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ramazan mein roza rakha; jab Usfan pahunche to iftar kiya"
"2831","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Arafat se aae aur logon ne sawariyan daudaain to logon mein pukara gaya: Aey logon, neaakii ghode-oont dauraanaa nahin hai Main ne hath uthae dauratii nahin dekhi yahan tak ke Muzdalifah pahunche"
"2832","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Muzdalifah ki raat kamzor gharwalon ko aage bheja mein se chhote ladke ke paas aae, use pair se harkat aur farmaya: Suraj nikalne tak jamaraatula-Aqabah na maro"
"2833","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor aur A'mash se, Zarr se, Abdullah bin Shaddad bin haadii se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, mein se aadmi dil mein khayal pata hai, koyalaa hona use bolne se pasandeeda hai? Donon mein se ek ne kaha: Unhon ne kaha: Shukr hai Jis ne tum par vasavase ke siwa qadir na paya doosre ne kaha: Shukr hai Jis ne us ke mamle ko vasavase tak diya"
"2834","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor aur A'mash se, Salim bin Abu Ja'd se, Kuraib bin Abu Muslim se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar mein se ek — ya: Tum se ek — biwi ke paas jae aur kahe: Aey Allah, mujhe shaitan se bacha, mere rizq se shaitan gaya un ke darmiyan bachcha muqaddar ho to shaitan use nuqsan na dega — ya: Shaitan us par qaboo na paaegaa. A'mash ne use marfu' nahin kiya, Mansoor ne marfu' kiya"
"2835","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salamah bin Kuhail se, unhon ne kaha: Kuraib bin Abu Muslim ko suna, Ibn Abbas se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Main ne khala Maimunah ke ghar raat bitaaii aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki nigaraanii ki unhon ne kaha: Soe, phir jage, chehra-hath dhoya, phir hue phir jage, mashkeeza ke paas uthe, us ka tasma khola — ya'ni us ka baandhanaa — phir bartan-katore mein undelaa. chehra-hath dhoya aur achcha wuzu kiya, do wuzu ke tak phir namaz ke liye khade hue; main baayen khada hua, mujhe daayen kiya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz terah rak'aten poori huin sajde mein kehte the — ya kaha namaz mein, Shu'bah ko shak hua: Aey Allah, mere kaan mein Noor kar, dil mein Noor kar, aankh mein Noor kar, upar se Noor kar, neeche se Noor kar, peeche se Noor kar, samne se Noor kar, daayen se Noor kar, baayen se Noor kar, mujhe Noor bana — ya: Mujhe Noor de, Shu'bah ko shak hua phir soe yahan tak ke kharraataa liya; ham neend kharrate se pahchante the phir namaz ke liye nikle"
"2836","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Uqbah ne mujhe khabar di, Kuraib se, Ibn Abbas se, ke aurat ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se apne ladke ke bare mein poocha: Kya us ke liye Hajj hai? Farmaya: Tumhen sawab hai"
"2837","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ammar bin Abu Ammar se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Main baap ke sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas dakhil hua mere baap un se baat karne lage jabke woh munh phere aadmi ki taraf mutawajjah the jab nikle to mujh se kaha: Aey beta, Kya Tum ne chacha ke bete ko dekha? Main un se baat karta tha, woh jawab na dete the main ne kaha: Aey baap, Kya Tum ne us aadmi ko nahin dekha jo un ke paas tha, un se baat karta tha? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin unhon ne kaha: Kya un ke paas koi tha? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han unhon ne kaha: Woh aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya Aap paas koi tha? Farmaya: Tum ne use dekha? Unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne mujhe woh bataya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) meri taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: Tum ne use dekha? Main ne kaha: Ji Han farmaya: Woh Jibreel the"
"2838","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Ammar bin Abu Ammar se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Unhon ne yeh aayat padhi: {Aaj tumhara deen kamil kiya, tum par nemat sare ki, tumhare liye Islam deen pasand kiya}. un ke paas Yahood mein se aadmi tha aur us ne kaha: Agar ham par yeh nazil hoti to us ke din ko Eid banaate. to Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Woh Jume ke din nazil hui, Arafat ke din — ya Arafat ki shaama."
"2839","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bara bin Ghanawi Yazid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu nazaraa ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz ke baad chaar se panah mangte the, kehte the: Main Allah ki panah mangta hun qabr ki aazmaish, jiivana-maut ki aazmaish, kaane jhoote ki aazmaish se"
"2840","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu nazaraa se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne Basrah ke mimbar par hamen khutba diya, Allah Azza-wa Jall ki tareef-sana ki, phir kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi Nabi nahin magar us ki dua hai; sab duniya mein jaldi mangi Main ne apni dua qayamat ke din ummat ki shafa'at ke liye rok rakhi Khabardar, main qayamat ke din Bani-Adam ka sardar hun, fakhr nahin qayamat ke din sab pahle mujh se zameen phategii, fakhr nahin mere hath mein hamd ka jhanda hai, us ke neeche Adam-neeche wale hain, fakhr nahin us din ki sakhti logon par bhaari hogi aur kahenge: Hamen Adam ke paas le chalo, insan ke baap, hamare Rabb se hamare liye shafa'at karen yahan tak ke hamare darmiyan faisla kare to Adam ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Tumhen Allah ne hath se paida kiya, apni jannat thahraya, farishton se sajdah karaya hamare Rabb se hamare liye shafa'at karo yahan tak ke hamare darmiyan faisla kare to kahenge: Main wahan nahin hun; main gunah se jannat se rawana aaj mujhe apni fikr hai Nuh ke paas jao, pahle nabii. to Nuh ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Hamare Rabb se hamare liye shafa'at karo yahan tak ke hamare darmiyan faisla kare to kahenge: Main wahan nahin hun; Main ne badaduaa ki jis se zameen wale duube. aaj mujhe apni fikr hai Ibrahim ke paas jao, Allah ke khaliila. to Ibrahim ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Hamare Rabb se hamare liye shafa'at karo yahan tak ke hamare darmiyan faisla kare to kahenge: Main wahan nahin hun; Main ne Islam mein teen jhoot kahe aaj mujhe apni fikr hai — unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, Unhon ne un se Allah ke deen ke siwa kuch na chaha; kehna: {Main beemar hun}, kehna: {Bade ne yeh kiya}, sara se kehna: Kaho: Woh mera bhai hai — Musa ke paas jao, banda jise Allah ne rasaalata-kalaam se cunaa. to Musa ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Hamare Rabb se hamare liye shafa'at karo yahan tak ke hamare darmiyan faisla kare to kahenge: Main wahan nahin hun; Main ne haq jaan qatl ki aaj mujhe apni fikr hai Isa ke paas jao, Allah ki rooh-kalimaa. to Isa ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Hamare Rabb se hamare liye shafa'at karo yahan tak ke hamare darmiyan faisla kare to kahenge: Main wahan nahin hun; mujhe-meri walidah ko Allah ke siwa do ma'bood banaya gaya lekin batao, agar saaman bartan mein ho jis par mohar ho, Kya bartan ke andar pahunche yahan tak ke mohar kare? To kahenge: Nahin to kahenge: Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aaj aae, un ke agle-pichhle bakhshe gaye Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log mere paas aayenge aur kahenge: Hamare Rabb se hamare liye shafa'at karo yahan tak ke hamare darmiyan faisla kare to main kahunga: Mere zimme, mere zimme. yahan tak ke Allah Azza-wa Jall jise chahe-pasand kare ijazat de jab Allah Azza-wa Jall makhlooq ke darmiyan faisla jawab to pukaarne wala pukaarega: Ahmad-ummat kahan hain? To main khada hounga, meri ummat mere peeche calegii, wuzu ke nishan se camakate hue Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ham aakhri-pahle hain; pahle hisab wale, Hajj hamare raste se hatengii. Hajj kahengii: Yeh ummat qareeb thi Nabi jaisi ho Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main jannat ke darwaze par pahuncuungaa aur phailane ko kahuungaa. kaha jaega: Kaun hai? To main kahunga: Ahamada. to mere liye khola jayega main apne Rabb ke paas pahuncuungaa, woh Arsh par hai sajde mein giruungaa. apne Rabb ki tareef aisi taariifon se karunga jo mujh se pahle kisi ne na ki, na mere baad koi karega to mujh se kaha jaega: Sar uthao, kaho suni jaegi, mango liye, shafa'at karo qabool hogi to main shafa'at karunga aur kaha jaega: Jao, aag se nikalo jis ke dil mein itni-itni bhalai ho to jaunga aur unhen dunga phir apne Rabb ki taraf lautuungaa, sajde mein giruungaa. to mujh se kaha jaega: Sar uthao, kaho suni jaegi, shafa'at karo qabool hogi, mango milta unhon ne kaha: Mere liye hadd muqarrar hogi, unhen dunga"
"2841","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nuh bin Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin nukarii Malik ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu jauzaa se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche namaz padhti thi, sab khuubasuurata. unhon ne kaha: Log mardon ki aakhri safon mein namaz padhte the taake use dekhen. unhon ne kaha: Mein se ek thaile se use dekhta tha, ek pehli saf mein aage badhega tha taake use na dekhe to Allah Azza-wa Jall ne yeh aayat nazil ki: {Ham ne tum aage-peeche walon ko jana}."
"2842","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin baharaanii Ubaid se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne lakdi-tumba-naqeer-roghan se mana kiya"
"2843","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Hajjaj se, Yahya bin baharaanii Ubaid se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye mashkize mein nabeez banai jati thi; us din-doosre din teesre din tak peete the agar kuch bachta to baha dete the"
"2844","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Abu Isra'il ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin baharaanii Ubaid se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye mashkize mein nabeez banai jati thi; us din-doosre din peete the Shu'bah ne kaha: Asr tak Abu Isra'il ne kaha: Teesre din tak; agar kuch bachta to baha dete the"
"2845","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Maimunah ki Aal ke jama ghee mein chuha gaya to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke chuha-aasapaasa nikali jae"
"2846","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Sa'd bin Ubadah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se walidah ki nazr ke bare mein poocha; woh mariin aur use poori na kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ki taraf se poori karo"
"2847","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ramazan mein nikle; jab qadiida pahunche to iftar kiya baad wala-baad wala amal hi liya jata hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke amal mein se"
"2848","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hajj ka tamattu kiya"
"2849","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zubair bin Azdi khirriita ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Uqaili Shaqeeq ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne Basrah mein hamen khutba diya; khutba dete rahe yahan tak ke suraj dooba, sitare nikle Tameem ke beton mein se aadmi cipakaa, kehta tha: Namaz-namaz to Ibn Abbas ne un se kaha: Teri walidah na rahe, Tu mujhe sunnat sikhaataa hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do namazen jama ki — ya'ni Maghrib-ishaa. bin Shaqeeq ne kaha: Mere dil mein us se shak raha yahan tak ke Abu Hurairah se mila aur un se poocha, Unhon ne un ki sach ki"
"2850","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakhtari ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Ramazan ka chand dekha jabke ham Zat-irqa mein the Ham ne Ibn Abbas ke paas aadmi bheja, un se poocha to Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne use dikhane ke liye badhaya; agar tum par posheeda to ginti poori karo"
"2851","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakhtari ko suna, kehte hue: Main ne Ibn Abbas se salaf ke bare mein poocha khajoor mein, to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khajoor bechne se mana kiya yahan tak ke us mein se khae — ya khilaya jae — ya yahan tak ke taula jae to ek aadmi ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Taula Kya hai? To un ke paas aadmi ne kaha: Yahan tak ke andaza lagae Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah is aadmi par gussa hote the, kehte the: Kyun na khamosh raha yahan tak ke Ibn Abbas kehte"
"2852","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur ghair ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se — Shu'bah ne kaha: Umar bin Harmalah se, ghair ne kaha: bin Harmalah se — Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Meri khala ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ghee-goh-doodh tohfe mein diya un ke paas Khalid baayen bin Waleed taraf the, main daayen taraf tha Unhon ne us par thuukaa — ya'ni goh par, ya us ke jaisi baat — to Khalid ne un se kaha: goya Tum ne use napasand kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Haan — ya kaha: Han to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne doodh piya aur farmaya: Ghoont tumhara hai; agar chaho Khalid ko de do — ya kaha: Chacha ko — ya: Cacere bhai ko, ya'ni Khalid ko to main ne kaha: Main tumhare hue par kisi ko tarjeeh na dunga unhon ne kaha: Mujhe diya aur Main ne piya, phir Khalid ko pilaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main koi mashroob nahin janta jo khane ki jagah kafi ho siwae doodh ke jab tum se ek use piye to kahe: Aey Allah, hamen us mein barkat de, hamen us se gaya jo tum se khana khae — ya'ni us goh mein se — to kahe: Aey Allah, hamen us mein barkat de, hamen us se behtar khilaao."
"2853","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Tau'mah ke aazad-karda Salih se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Fazl ki walidah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf doodh ka bartan bheja jabke Aap Arafat mein Arafah ke din khade the; Aap ne piya"
"2854","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Qariz se, Abu Ghatfan se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ko wuzu karte dekha; kulli-naak mein pani dala do martaba aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum se ek kulli kare aur naak jhaade to do martaba achchi tarah kare, ya teen martaba"
"2855","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas ke aazad-karda Shu'bah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Abbas gadhi par aae jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padh rahe the ham utre aur un ke samne guzre; Unhon ne hamen na diya na mana kiya"
"2856","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, unhon ne kaha: bin aadmi Abbas ke paas aaya aur kaha: Tumhara aazad jab sajdah kare to hath pahlu se samete. to Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Woh kutte jaisa baithna hai Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki thaile ki safedi dekhi jabke woh sajde mein the"
"2857","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas jab janabat se ghusl karte to daayen se baayen par saat martaba undelate the unhon ne kaha: Ek din baayen par dalne lage aur mujh se kaha: tum jante ho kitna dala? Main ne kaha: Nahin unhon ne kaha: Teri walidah na rahe, kyun nahin janta? To baayen par saat martaba undelaa, namaz ka wuzu kiya, phir sar par diya phir kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko isi karte dekha"
"2858","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas ke aazad-karda Shu'bah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe kamzor gharwalon mein bheja; Ham ne Fajr ke sath Jamrah mara"
"2859","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas ke aazad-karda Shu'bah se, unhon ne kaha: bin Makhramah Miswar Abbas ke paas dakhil hue jabke woh beemar the, un par shagaaf kapda tha, samne tasviiron wali angiithii thi to Miswar ne kaha: Yeh Kya hai, bin Aey Abbas? Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Mujhe ma'loom na tha; main nahin samajhta Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is se mana kiya magar ghamanda-sarkashi ke liye shukr hai ham isi nahin hain jab Miswar nikle to Ibn Abbas ne kapde ka hukm diya aur woh un se utara gaya aur kaha: In tasviiron ke sar kaato."
"2860","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Baharaama ke bete Abdul-Hameed ne ham se bayan kiya, Shahr bin Haushab se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahood ki jama'at ek din Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamen un baton ki khabar den jin ke bare mein ham Aap se un, jinhein sirf Nabi janta farmaya: Jo chaho mujh se poocho, lekin mujhe Allah ka ahd do aur jo Yaqub ne beton se liya tha, agar Main ne tumhen kuch khabar jise tum pahacaano to mujh se Islam par bai'at karoge. unhon ne kaha: Tumhen woh milta farmaya: Jo chaho mujh se poocho unhon ne kaha: Hamen chaar baton ki khabar den jin ke bare mein ham Aap se un: Hamen us khane ki khabar den jo Isra'il ne Taurat se pahle nafs par haram kiya; hamen aurat-mard ke pani ki khabar den, us se ladka kaise kar ladka hota hai, us se ladki kaise kar ladki hoti hai; hamen bataaen Nabi ki neend kaisi hai, farishton mein tumhara dost kaun hai? Farmaya: Tum par Allah ka ahd-paimaana hai, agar Main ne tumhen khabar to mujh se bai'at karoge? To Unhon ne use ahd-paimaana diya jo Us ne irada farmaya: Tumhen qasam deta hun us Allah ki Jis ne Musa par Taurat nazil ki, Kya tum jante ho Isra'il-Yaqub sakht beemar hue, un ki lambi beemari hui Unhon ne Allah se nazr mani, agar Us ne beemari se shifa di to pasandeeda mashroob-pasandeeda khana haram karenge un ka pasandeeda mashroob untni ka doodh tha, pasandeeda khana oont ka gosht tha? Unhon ne kaha: Aey Allah, Han to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah, un par gawah rehna unhon ne kaha: Tumhen qasam deta hun us Allah ki jis ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, Jis ne Musa par Taurat nazil ki, Kya tum jante ho mard ka pani gaarhaa-safed hai, aurat ka pani patalaa-zard hai jo ghalib aae, bachcha-mushabahat usi ka hai Allah ke ijazat se agar mard ka pani aurat ke pani par ghalib aae to ladka hoga Allah ke ijazat se agar aurat ka pani mard ke pani par ghalib aae to ladki hogi Allah ke ijazat se? Unhon ne kaha: Aey Allah, Han to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah, gawah rehna unhon ne kaha: Tumhen qasam deta hun us Allah ki Jis ne Musa par Taurat nazil ki, Kya tum jante ho Nabi ki aankhen soti hain, dil nahin sota? Unhon ne kaha: Aey Allah, Han unhon ne kaha: Aey Allah, un par gawah rehna unhon ne kaha: Ab tum batao, farishton mein tumhara dost kaun hai; usi par ham milenge ya juda honge farmaya: Mera dost Jibreel hai; Allah Azza-wa Jall ne koi Nabi nahin bheja magar woh us ka dost hai unhon ne kaha: Usi par ham se juda ho; agar tumhara dost us ke siwa farishton mein se hota to tum bai'at karte, tumhari sach karte unhon ne kaha: Tumhen us ki sach se Kya roke hai? Unhon ne kaha: Woh farishton mein hamara dushman hai to Allah Azza-wa Jall ne nazil kiya: {Jo Jibreel ka dushman ho, Us ne tumhare dil par Allah ke ijazat se utara} aayat ke aakhir tak aur nazil hui: {Woh gussa par gussa lekar aae}."
"2861","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Abu Ma'bad se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat mahram ke baghair safar na kare; aadmi us ke paas dakhil na ho magar us ke paas mahram hazir ho to ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, meri biwi Hajj karna chahti hai, main falan-falan lashkar mein nikalna chahta hun to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni biwi ke sath Hajj karo"
"2862","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin juhaadaa se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salih ko suna — woh boodhe ho chuke the — Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qabron ki ziyarat karne wali aurton par lanat ki, un par jo unhen masjid-diye banao"
"2863","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd sukaina bin Abdi Aziz ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas se, ke Fazl Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche Arafat ke din sawar the aur aurat ko dekhne lage to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Thehro, Aey ladke; yeh woh din hai jis mein nazar ki hifazat kare, use bakhsha jayega"
"2864","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Abu Sallam se, Hakam bin Mina se, ke Abdullah Ibn Abbas aur Abdullah Ibn Umar ne bayan kiya, ke Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko mimbar ki lakdi par farmate suna: Qaum Jume chhorne se ba'z aaengii ya un ke dilon par mohar lagegii, woh ghafilon mein likha jayenge"
"2865","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu khazzaaza aamiira ne ham se bayan kiya, bin Abu Mulaikah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Main namaz padh raha tha, mu'azzin iqamat kehne wahan to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe kheencha aur farmaya: Kya Fajr chaar padhte ho?."
"2866","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Abu safar ko suna, Sa'id bin shufii se bayan karte hue, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab safar mein ghar se nikalte to laut tak do-do rak'aten padhte the"
"2867","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr se, Ausaja se, Ibn Abbas se, ke aadmi ne apna ghulam aazad kiya, phir mara jabke us ke siwa koi waris na tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use us se wirasat dilaaii; neeche wale ko upar se wirasat dilaaii."
"2868","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Tamimi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas se miswak ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen us ka hukm dete rahe yahan tak ke hamen dar hua ke us mein Aap par nazil hoga"
"2869","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Tamimi ko suna, Ibn Abbas se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki thaile ki safedi dekhi jabke woh sajde mein the"
"2870","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Talha bin Abdullah bin Auf ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas ke peeche janaze par namaz padhi jabke main us din jawan tha Main ne unhen us par Surah-Fatiha padhte suna jab Main ne namaz padhi to aaya aur un ka hath pakda, aur kaha: Aey Aba-Abbas, yeh Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Yeh haq-sunnat hai — ya kaha: Sunnat-haq hai"
"2871","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Musa bin Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Jab Masjid-haram mein namaz na paun, Batha mein kitni padhun? Unhon ne kaha: Do rak'aten; woh Aba-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat hai"
"2872","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salamah bin Kuhail ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Sulami Hakam ko suna, Ibn Abbas se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) biwiyon se Maheena bhar alag rahe phir Jibreel un ke paas aae aur kaha: Aey Muhammad, Maheena poora hua; Maheena untees din hai"
"2873","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se: Main ne Ibn Abbas se nabeez ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne matakaa-tumba se mana kiya Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Jo Allah-Rasulullah ka haram haram samjhe, woh nabeez haram samajhe."
"2874","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam aur Abu Bishr se, Maimun bin maharaana se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne har nakhun wale darinde aur har panje wale parinde se mana kiya"
"2875","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim aur Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu qassaaba Hamzah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mu'awiyah ki taraf bheja taake woh un ke liye likhe. to unhon ne kaha: Woh kha raha hai phir un ki taraf bheja aur unhon ne kaha: Woh kha raha hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us ka pet na bhare. Abdullah bin Ja'far bin Faris ne kaha — Yunus bin Habib se riwayat karne wale ne: Matlab, Allah behtar jane: Duniya mein Allah us ka pet na phaad taake qayamat ke din bhuukhon mein se na ho; kyunke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se khabar hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Duniya mein sab zyada pet phaad log qayamat ke din sab zyada bhooke honge"
"2876","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Nasr Imran Jamrah se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ko kehte suna: Abdul-Qais ka wafd jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya to farmaya: Qaum kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Rabi'ah se farmaya: Wafd ko khushaamdeed, na zillat na nadamat hai to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham Rabi'ah ka qabeela hain, ham door desh se Aap paas aate hain hamare-Aap darmiyan Muzar ke kafiron ka yeh qabeela hai ham Aap tak haram mahine ke siwa nahin pahunch rakhta hamen faisalakun hukm den jis se peeche walon ko bulayein aur us se jannat mein dakhil hon to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhen chaar ka hukm deta hun, chaar se mana karta hun tumhen Allah par iman ka hukm deta hun tum jante ho Allah par iman Kya hai? Gawahi ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, Muhammad Allah ke Rasulullah hain, namaz qayam karna, zakat dena, Ramazan roza, ghanimat ka panchwan hun tumhen chaar se mana karta hun: Tumba-lakdi-naqeer-roghan se shayad kaha: Qiira se unhen yaad rakho, peeche walon ko bulao"
"2877","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Jamrah se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat mein terah rak'aten padhte the"
"2878","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Jamrah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne tamattu kiya — ya'ni Hajj mein — aur Ibn Abbas se poocha, Unhon ne mujhe us ka hukm diya jab main soya to khwab mein dekha goya kehne wala kehta hai: Maqbool Hajj-maqbool umrah to main Ibn Abbas ke paas aaya aur un se woh bataya to unhon ne kaha: Ka'ba ke Rabb ki qasam, Aba-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat hai to unhon ne kaha: Mere paas thehro, tumhen maal mein hissa dunga unhon ne kaha: Main thehra; main un ke-logon ke darmiyan tarjuman tha woh mujhe apne sath takht par bithate the"
"2879","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Jamrah se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki qabr mein surkh makhamala dali gayi"
"2880","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Jamrah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Makkah mein terah saal rahe, Aap Wahy hoti thi; Madinah mein das saal rahe wafat hui jabke Aap tirsath saal ke the"
"2881","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Balj se, Amr bin Maimun se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ali se farmaya: Tum mere baad har mo'min ke dost ho"
"2882","[AI-translation] Usi sanad se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Khadijah ke baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath pahle namaz Ali ne padhi"
"2883","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Jazzar ko suna, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padh rahe the; bakri ka bachcha samne guzarna chahta tha, Aap use samne se na guzarne ke liye rokne lage"
"2884","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam aur Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd bin jazarii Karim se, Tameem ke beton mein se ek aadmi se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kutte ki qeemat, badkar ki ujrat, sharab ki qeemat haram hai"
"2885","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu nabina Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, naam liye aadmi se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Quraish ke javaanon, zina na karo; jise Allah javaanii samet rakhe, woh jannat mein dakhil hoga"
"2886","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq bin Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Abbas ke paas tha; un ke paas aadmi aaya aur kaha: Tum kaun ho? To Unhon ne door ke rishte se nisbat jataaii. Unhon ne us ke liye baat Narmi ki aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nasab pahacaano, rishte joroge. qareeb kar bhi kate rishte se qurb nahin, door kar bhi jure rishte se doori nahin"
"2887","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah bin Abu Yazid se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe raat ko Muzdalifah se gharwalon ke saaman mein aage bheja"
"2888","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir bin Hazim, salma bin zariira, Hammad bin Najeeh aur Sakhr bin Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Raja se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne jannat dekhi, us ke zyada rehne wale ghareeb the jahannam dekhi, us ki zyada rehne wali aurten thin"
"2889","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Auza'i se, Muttalib se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek-ek martaba wuzu kiya"
"2890","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah aur Kharijah bin masaaba ne ham se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Aslam se, Abd bin Rahman bin Wa'lah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Ham Mashriq ki taraf jihad karte hain aur hamen mashkize jane jate hain, ham nahin jante woh Kya hain unhon ne kaha: Main nahin janta tum Kya kehte ho, siwae is ke ke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Har khaal jo rangii jae, pak hui"
"2891","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Yahya bin Jazzar se, Suhaib se — main ne kaha: Suhaib kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Basrah walon mein se aadmi — Ibn Abbas se, ke woh gadhe par the, woh aur Bani Hashim ka ladka; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne guzre jabke woh namaz padh rahe the, Aap us ke liye na aur Muttalib ke beton ki do bacciyaan aaeen aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ghutne pakde; Aap ne donon ke darmiyan cheera — ya'ni alag kiya — us ke liye na aur"
"2892","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, qurrii Muslim se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajj ka ehram bandha; sahaba mein se jin ke sath qurbani na thi, halal hue; jin ke sath qurbani thi, halal na hue Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Talha qurbani walon mein se the"
"2893","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu majalaza se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas se witr ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Raat ke aakhir mein ek rak'at hai"
"2894","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid aur Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Sa'id bin Huwairis se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) paikhaane se nikle; unhon ne kaha: Aap liye wuzu laen? To farmaya: Kya main namaz parhuungaa ke wuzu karun"
"2895","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Hamen Ibn Abbas se sunne wale ne khabar di, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, ke Aap ne peshab kiya phir khane lage un se kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ne peshab kiya hai to farmaya: Kya main namaz padhne ka irada rakhta hun"
"2896","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sauri Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Salamah bin Kuhail se, Urani Hasan se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen Muzdalifah se gadhiyon par Muttalib ke beton ke chhote bachchon ko aage bheja hamari raanen thapthapane lage aur farmate the: Aey beton, suraj nikalne tak jamaraatula-Aqabah na maro Musnad ka aakhir hai; shukr Allah ke liye hai, jahanon ke Rabb ke liye"
